<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CH" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Yudaya Mangɛe I</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yudaya Mangɛe xa Taruxui Sɛniyɛnxi singe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yudaya Mangɛe I</para>
  <para style="toc3">YmI</para>
  <para style="mt">Yudaya Mangɛe xa Taruxui Sɛniyɛnxi singe</para>
  <para style="imt">Masenyi nde yi Kitaabui xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="ip">Isirayila findixi Ala xa ɲama nan na. E xa taruxui nɔma lɔnni belebele fide to mixie ma, barima na kui won nɔma a kolonde a lanma Ala xa konyie xa ɲɛrɛ ki naxɛ. Na taruxui toma kitaabui naani kui. Firin xili «Isirayila Mangɛe xa Taruxui,» yi boore firinyie xili «Yudaya Mangɛe xa Taruxui.» A singe, Isirayila nu lanxi si keren nan ma, kɔnɔ sɛɛti keren to kuye batu fɔlɔ, a naxa findi Isirayila ɲama ra, boore sɛɛti naxa findi Yudaya ɲama ra. Mangɛe birin xa taruxui sɛbɛxi «Isirayila Mangɛe xa Taruxui» firinyi kui. «Yudaya Mangɛe xa Taruxui» firinyi, Yudaya mangɛe xa fe nan gbansan masenma.</para>
  <para style="ip">«Yudaya Mangɛe xa Taruxui» kitaabui singe fɔlɔma sora solomanaani nan ma, naxee mixi xilie masenma naxee bara lu duniɲa kelife baba Adama xa waxati han mangɛ Sɔlu xa waxati. Sɔlu findixi Isirayila mangɛ singe nan na. Ala naxa a sugandi, kɔnɔ a mu bu Ala xa kira xɔn ma. Na na a ra, Ala naxa Dawuda ti a ɲɔxɔɛ ra. Dawuda findixi Isirayila mangɛ xungbe nan na, naxan fata ɲama raɲɛrɛde, a man fata birade Ala xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra. Ala naxa barakɛ sa a xa fe ma han a xili xungbe sɔtɔ duniɲa birin ma. Ala naxa saatɛ tongo Dawuda nun a bɔnsɔɛ bɛ, a xa di nde xa Ala xa ɲama raɲɛrɛ abadan. Na taruxui birin sɛbɛxi yi kitaabui singe nan kui.</para>
  <para style="ip">«Yudaya Mangɛe xa Taruxui» kitaabui firin nde fɔlɔma Dawuda xa di Sulemani xa mangɛya xa taruxui nan ma. Sulemani naxa bira a baba ɲɛrɛ ki fɔxɔ ra. A naxa ɲama yamari lɔnni ra, a man naxa Ala batu sɔɔbɛ ra. Ala naxa tin Sulemani xa a xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi ti Darisalamu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sulemani to faxa, a xa di Robowami naxa ti a ɲɔxɔɛ ra. Robowami naxa a tuli mati a lanfanmae xa marasi ra naxee bara a niya Isirayilakae bɔɲɛ xa raɲaaxu e ma. Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ fu naxa mini Robowami xa yaamari bun ma, e Yerobowami ti e xa mangɛ ra. Robowami xa mangɛya xili nɛ Yudaya, Yerobowami xa mangɛya xili nɛ Isirayila.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mangɛ naxee tixi Robowami dangi xanbi, ndee findixi mangɛ fanyie nan na naxee bira Ala xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra. Kɔnɔ ndee mu tin Ala xa kira ra, e fa kuye batu, e mixi tɔɔrɔ. Na kui Ala naxa e ɲaxankata si gbɛtɛe saabui ra naxee fa e gerede. Yudayakae to na tɔɔrɛ to, e naxa gbilen Ala ma, Ala fan naxa e tongo, a e mali nɔde e yaxuie ra. Mangɛ fanyie nun mangɛ ɲaaxie nu fa masara e boore tagi. Na mɔɔli naxa bu ɲɛ kɛmɛ saxan ɲɛ tongo solofere nun firin. A raɲɔnyi Ala naxa a lu Isirayila nun Yudaya yaxuie xa nɔ e ra, e e xanin konyiya kui Asiriya nun Babilɔn bɔxi ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yi taruxui makinikini, barima a a masenma won bɛ mixi naxan na hɛɛri kui, e nɔma Ala rabolode, na fa findi konyiya xɔrɔxɔɛ ra e bɛ. Ala xa won natanga na ma. Isirayila ɲama xa findi misaali ra won bɛ. Xa won luma Ala xa kira xɔn ma, won ma duniɲɛigiri fanma nɛ, kɔnɔ xa won tondima na ra, won tɔɔrɛ gbansan nan sɔtɔma. Ala xa na lɔnni raso won xaxili kui. Amina.</para>
  <para style="imte">Yudaya Mangɛe xa Taruxui Sɛniyɛnxi singe</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CH 1" />
  <para style="s">Benba Adama han Annabi Iburahima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 5:1-32">Fe Fɔlɔ Fɔlɛ 5:1-32</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 10:1-32">10:1-32</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 11:10-32">11:10-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 1:1" />Adama naxa Seti sɔtɔ. Seti naxa Enosi sɔtɔ. Enosi naxa Kenan sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 1:2" />Kenan naxa Mahalaleli sɔtɔ. Mahalaleli naxa Yeredi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 1:3" />Yeredi naxa Enoki sɔtɔ. Enoki naxa Metusela sɔtɔ. Metusela naxa Lemeki sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 1:4" />Lemeki naxa Nuha sɔtɔ. Nuha naxa di xɛmɛ saxan sɔtɔ: Semi, Hami, nun Yefeti.<verse eid="1CH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 1:5" />Yefeti xa die nan ya: Gomeri, Magogo, Madayi, Yawani, Tubali, Meseki, nun Tirasi. <verse eid="1CH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 1:6" />Gomeri xa die nan ya: Asikenasi, Rifati, nun Togarama. <verse eid="1CH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 1:7" />Yawani xa die nan ya: Elisaha, Tarasisi, Kitimi, nun Rodanimi.<verse eid="1CH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 1:8" />Hami xa die nan ya: Kusi, Misirayimi, Puti, nun Kanaan. <verse eid="1CH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 1:9" />Kusi xa die nan ya: Seba, Xawila, Sabata, Raama, nun Sabiteka. Raama xa die nan ya: Seeba nun Dedan. <verse eid="1CH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 1:10" />Kusi naxa Nimirodi bari, naxan findi geresoe singe ra adamadie tagi. <verse eid="1CH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 1:11" />Misirayimi naxa die sɔtɔ, naxee findixi Ludukae, Anamikae, Lehabakae, Nafatukae, <verse eid="1CH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 1:12" />Patirusukae, Kasaluxukae, nun Kafatorokae ra. Filisitakae benba na Kafatoro nan na. <verse eid="1CH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 1:13" />Kanaan naxa die sɔtɔ, naxee findixi Sidɔnkae, Xitikae, <verse eid="1CH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 1:14" />Yebusukae, Amorikae, Girigasakae, <verse eid="1CH 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 1:15" />Hiwikae, Arakakae, Sinikae, <verse eid="1CH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 1:16" />Arawadakae, Semarakae, nun Xamatakae ra.<verse eid="1CH 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 1:17" />Semi xa die nan ya: Elama, Asuri, Arafaxadi, Ludu, nun Arami. Arami xa die nan ya: Usu, Xulu, Geteri, nun Meseki. <verse eid="1CH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 1:18" />Arafaxadi naxa Sela sɔtɔ. Sela naxa Eberi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 1:19" />Eberi naxa di xɛmɛ firin sɔtɔ. Keren xili Pelegi barima bɔxi itaxunxi a xa waxati. A firin nde xili Yokatan. <verse eid="1CH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 1:20" />Yokatan xa die nan ya: Alomodadi, Selefa, Xasaramawete, Yera, <verse eid="1CH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 1:21" />Hadorami, Usali, Dikila, <verse eid="1CH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 1:22" />Obala, Abimayele, Seeba, Ofiri, Xawila, nun Yobabo. <verse eid="1CH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 1:23" />Yokatan xa die nan na ki.<verse eid="1CH 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 1:24" />Semi naxa Arafaxadi sɔtɔ. Arafaxadi naxa Sela sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 1:25" />Sela naxa Eberi sɔtɔ. Eberi naxa Pelegi sɔtɔ. Pelegi naxa Rewu sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 1:26" />Rewu naxa Serugu sɔtɔ. Serugu naxa Naxori sɔtɔ. Naxori naxa Tera sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 1:27" />Tera naxa Iburama sɔtɔ naxan findi Iburahima ra.<verse eid="1CH 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Annabi Iburahima xa die</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 25:1-4">Fe Fɔlɔ Fɔlɛ 25:1-4</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 12:-1-16">12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 1:28" />Iburahima xa die nan ya: Isiyaga nun Sumayila. <verse eid="1CH 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 1:29" />Sumayila xa die nan ya: Sumayila xa di singe Nebayoti, Kedari, Adabeeli, Mibisami, <verse eid="1CH 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 1:30" />Misema, Duma, Masa, Hadada, Tema, <verse eid="1CH 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 1:31" />Yeturi, Nafisi, nun Kedema. Sumayila xa die nan na ki.<verse eid="1CH 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 1:32" />Iburahima xa konyi ginɛ Ketura xa die nan ya a naxee bari Iburahima bɛ: Simiran, Yokosan, Medan, Madiyan, Yisebaki, nun Suuwa. Yokosan naxa Seeba nun Dedan sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 1:33" />Madiyan naxa Efa, Efere, Xanɔki, Abida, nun Elidaa sɔtɔ. Yi die birin fatanxi Ketura nan na.<verse eid="1CH 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 1:34" />Iburahima naxa Isiyaga sɔtɔ. Isiyaga xa die nan ya: Esayu nun Isirayila. <verse eid="1CH 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 1:35" />Esayu xa die nan ya: Elifasi, Reyuweli, Yeyusu, Yalami, nun Kora. <verse eid="1CH 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 1:36" />Elifasi xa die nan ya: Teman, Omaru, Sefi, Gatami, Kenasi, Timina, nun Amalɛki. <verse eid="1CH 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 1:37" />Reyuweli xa die nan ya: Naxati, Sera, Saama, nun Misa.<verse eid="1CH 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 1:38" />Seyiri xa die nan ya: Lotan, Sobali, Sibeyon, Ana, Dison, Eseri, nun Disan. <verse eid="1CH 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 1:39" />Lotan xa die nan ya: Xori nun Homami. Lotan maaginɛ xili Timina. <verse eid="1CH 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 1:40" />Sobali xa die nan ya: Aliban, Manaxati, Ebali, Sefi, nun Onan. Sibeyon xa die nan ya: Aya nun Ana. <verse eid="1CH 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 1:41" />Ana xa di xili Dison. Dison xa die nan ya: Xemedan, Eseban, Yitiran, nun Keran. <verse eid="1CH 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 1:42" />Eseri xa die nan ya: Bilihan, Saawan, Yaakan. Disan xa die nan ya: Usu nun Aran.<verse eid="1CH 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 1:43" />Mangɛe nan ya naxee bara Edon bɔxi yamari beenu Isirayilakae xa mangɛ nde sɔtɔ: Beyori xa di Bela, naxan kelixi Dinhaba taa. <verse eid="1CH 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 1:44" />Bela to faxa, Sera xa di Yobabo, naxan kelixi Bosara, naxa bɔxi yamari. <verse eid="1CH 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 1:45" />Yobabo to faxa, Xusama, naxan kelixi Teman, naxa bɔxi yamari. <verse eid="1CH 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 1:46" />Xusama to faxa, Bedada xa di Hadada, naxan nu bara Madiyankae bɔnbɔ Mowaba bɔxi ma, naxa bɔxi yamari. A kelixi Abiti taa nɛ. <verse eid="1CH 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 1:47" />Hadada to faxa, Masareka Samala naxa bɔxi yamari. <verse eid="1CH 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 1:48" />Samala to faxa, Sawulu naxan kelixi Rehoboti, taa naxan na xure dɛ ra, naxa bɔxi yamari. <verse eid="1CH 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 1:49" />Sawulu to faxa, Akibori xa di Bali Xanan naxa bɔxi yamari. <verse eid="1CH 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 1:50" />Bali Xanan to faxa, Hadada, naxan kelixi Pawu, naxa bɔxi yamari. A xa ginɛ xili Mehetabeli. Na nga xili Matirɛdi, a mama xili Mesahabi. <verse eid="1CH 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 1:51" />Hadada fan naxa faxa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 1:51">Edon mangɛe nan ya: Timina, Aliba, Yeteti, <verse eid="1CH 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 1:52" />Oholibama, Ela, Pinon, <verse eid="1CH 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 1:53" />Kenasi, Teman, Mibisari, <verse eid="1CH 1:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 1:54" />Magadiyɛli, nun Irami. Edon mangɛe nan na ki.<verse eid="1CH 1:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CH 2" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila xa die</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 2:1" />Isirayila xa die nan ya: Ruben, Simeyɔn, Lewi, Yuda, Isakari, Sabulon, <verse eid="1CH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 2:2" />Dana, Yusufu, Bunyamin, Nafatali, Gadi, nun Aseri.<verse eid="1CH 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 2:3" />Yuda xa die nan ya: Eri, Onan, Sela. Suwa xa di ginɛ Kanaanka nan e barixi. Yuda xa di singe Eri naxa fe ɲaaxi raba Alatala ya i. A a faxa na nan ma. <verse eid="1CH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 2:4" />Yuda xa mamadi Tamari naxa Peresi nun Sera bari a bɛ. Yuda di suuli sɔtɔ na ki nɛ.<verse eid="1CH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 2:5" />Peresi xa die nan ya: Xesiron nun Xamuli. <verse eid="1CH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 2:6" />Sera xa di suulie nan ya: Simiri, Etani, Heman, Kalikɔli, nun Darada. <verse eid="1CH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 2:7" />Karimi naxa Akan sɔtɔ, naxan bara fe ɲaaxi raba Isirayila ra a to se ratɔnxi tongo. <verse eid="1CH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 2:8" />Etani naxa Asaraya sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 2:9" />Xesiron xa die nan ya: Yerameeli, Rami, nun Kalebi.<verse eid="1CH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 2:10" />Rami naxa Aminadabo sɔtɔ. Aminadabo naxa Naxason sɔtɔ, naxan findi Yudayakae xa mangɛ ra. <verse eid="1CH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 2:11" />Naxason naxa Salimon sɔtɔ. Salimon naxa Boosu sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 2:12" />Boosu naxa Obedo sɔtɔ. Obedo naxa Yisayi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 2:13" />Yisayi xa die nan ya: Eliyabi, a xa di singe, Abinadabo, a xa di firin nde, Simeya, a xa di saxan nde, <verse eid="1CH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 2:14" />Netaneeli, a xa di naani nde, Radayi, a xa di suuli nde, <verse eid="1CH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 2:15" />Osemi, a xa di senni nde, nun Dawuda, a xa di solofere nde. <verse eid="1CH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 2:16" />Yisayi xa di ginɛe nan ya: Seruya nun Abigayili. Seruya naxa di xɛmɛ saxan sɔtɔ: Abisayi, Yowaba, nun Asahɛli. <verse eid="1CH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 2:17" />Abigayili naxa Amasa sɔtɔ Yeteri bɛ, naxan fatanxi Sumayila bɔnsɔɛ ra.<verse eid="1CH 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 2:18" />Xesiron xa di Kalebi naxa die sɔtɔ a xa ginɛ Asuba ra. E xili Yesere, Sobabo, nun Aradon. A xa ginɛ Yeriyoti fan naxa di nde sɔtɔ a bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 2:19" />Asuba to faxa, Kalebi naxa Efarata dɔxɔ, naxan Xuru bari a bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 2:20" />Xuru naxa Uri sɔtɔ. Uri naxa Bɛsalɛli sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 2:21" />Xesiron to ɲɛ tongo senni sɔtɔ, a naxa Galadi baba Makiri xa di ginɛ dɔxɔ. E naxa Segubu sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 2:22" />Segubu naxa Yayiri sɔtɔ, naxan taa mɔxɔɲɛn nun saxan yaamari Galadi bɔxi ma. <verse eid="1CH 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 2:23" />Gesurikae nun Siriyakae naxa Yayiri xa taae sɔtɔ a nun Kenata nun taa tongo senni naxee na a rabilinyi. Yi mixi birin kelixi Makiri bɔnsɔɛ nɛ, Galadi baba. <verse eid="1CH 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 2:24" />Xesiron to faxa Kalebi Efarata, a xa ginɛ Abiya naxa Asexuri bari a bɛ, naxan findi Tekowa baba ra.<verse eid="1CH 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 2:25" />Xesiron xa di singe Yerameeli xa die nan ya: Rami, a xa di singe, Buna, Oreni, Osemi, nun Ahiya. <verse eid="1CH 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 2:26" />Yerameeli xa ginɛ boore Atara naxa Onan sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 2:27" />Yerameeli xa di singe Rami xa die nan ya: Maasa, Yamin, nun Ekeri. <verse eid="1CH 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 2:28" />Onan ma die nan ya: Samayi nun Yada. Samayi xa die nan ya: Nadabo nun Abisuri. <verse eid="1CH 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 2:29" />Abisuri xa ginɛ Abixayili naxa Axaban nun Molidi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 2:30" />Nadabo xa die nan ya: Seleda nun Apayimi. Seleda naxa faxa a ditare ra. <verse eid="1CH 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 2:31" />Apayimi naxa Yiseyi sɔtɔ. Yiseyi naxa Sesaan sɔtɔ. Sesaan naxa Axalayi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 2:32" />Samayi xunya Yada xa di nan ya: Yeteri nun Yonatan. Yeteri naxa faxa a ditare ra. <verse eid="1CH 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 2:33" />Yonatan xa die nan ya: Peleta nun Sasa. Yerameeli xa die nan na ki. <verse eid="1CH 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 2:34" />Sesaan mu di xɛmɛ yo sɔtɔ fo di ginɛe. A xa konyi Misiraka xili Yara. <verse eid="1CH 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 2:35" />Sesaan naxa a xa di ginɛ fi a xa konyi Yara ma. A naxa Atayi bari. <verse eid="1CH 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 2:36" />Atayi naxa Natan sɔtɔ. Natan naxa Sabadi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 2:37" />Sabadi naxa Efilali sɔtɔ. Efilali naxa Obedo sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 2:38" />Obedo naxa Yehu sɔtɔ. Yehu naxa Asaraya sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 2:39" />Asaraya naxa Xɛlɛsi sɔtɔ. Xɛlɛsi naxa Eleyasa sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 2:40" />Eleyasa naxa Sisimayi sɔtɔ. Sisimayi naxa Salumu sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 2:41" />Salumu naxa Yekamiya sɔtɔ. Yekamiya naxa Elisama sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 2:42" />Yerameeli xunya Kalebi xa di singe xili Mesa. Mesa naxa Sifi nun Maresa sɔtɔ, naxan findi Xebiron baba ra. <verse eid="1CH 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 2:43" />Xebiron xa die nan ya: Kora, Tapuwa, Rekemi, nun Sema. <verse eid="1CH 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 2:44" />Sema naxa Raxami sɔtɔ. Raxami naxa Yoreyami sɔtɔ. Rekemi naxa Samayi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 2:45" />Samayi naxa Mayon sɔtɔ. Mayon naxa Beti Suru sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 2:46" />Kalebi xa konyi ginɛ Efa xa die nan ya: Xarani, Mosa, nun Gasɛsi. Xarani naxa Gasɛsi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 2:47" />Yadayi xa die nan ya: Regemi, Yotami, Gesana, Pɛlɛti, Efa, nun Saafi. <verse eid="1CH 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 2:48" />Kalebi xa konyi ginɛ Maaka xa die nan ya: Seberi nun Tirana. <verse eid="1CH 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 2:49" />A man naxa Madamanna baba Saafi nun Makabena nun Gibiya baba Sewa bari. Kalebi xa di ginɛ xili Akasa. <verse eid="1CH 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 2:50" />Kalebi xa die nan ya: Sobali, Xuru xa di, a xa ginɛ Efarata xa di singe, Kiriyati Yeyarimi baba, <verse eid="1CH 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 2:51" />Salima, Bɛtɛlɛɛmu baba, nun Xarefa, Beti Gaderi baba. <verse eid="1CH 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 2:52" />Kiriyati Yeyarimi baba Sobali xa die nan ya: Harowe, Menuhoti bɔnsɔɛ tagi. <verse eid="1CH 2:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 2:53" />Kiriyati Yeyarimi xabilɛe nan ya: Itirikae, Putikae, Suumaka, nun Miserayikae. Soreyatakae nun Esetayolikae fatanxi e tan nan na. <verse eid="1CH 2:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 2:54" />Salima xa die nan ya: Bɛtɛlɛɛmu, Netofakae, Atiroti Beti Yowaba, Menuhoti bɔnsɔɛ tagi, Sorahakae, <verse eid="1CH 2:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 2:55" />sɛbɛlitie xabilɛ naxee sabatixi Yabɛsi, Tiratikae, Simeyatakae, nun Sukatikae. Kenikae nan na ki, naxee fatanxi Xamata, Rekabu baba ra.<verse eid="1CH 2:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CH 3" />
  <para style="s">Mangɛ Dawuda xa die</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 3:1" />Dawuda xa di naxee barixi Xebiron, nee nan ya: A xa di singe Aminon, naxan nga findi Axinowama ra Yisireelika, a xa di firin nde Daniyɛli, naxan nga findi Abigayili ra Karemeleka, <verse eid="1CH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 3:2" />a xa di saxan nde Abisalomi, naxan nga findi Gesuri mangɛ Talamayi xa di ginɛ Maaka ra, a xa di naani nde Adoniya, naxan nga findi Xagiti ra, <verse eid="1CH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 3:3" />a xa di suuli nde Sɛfataya, naxan nga findi Abitali ra, a xa di senni nde Yitireyami, naxan nga findi Egela ra. <verse eid="1CH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 3:4" />Yi di senni barixi Xebiron nɛ. Dawuda naxa mangɛya raba Xebiron ɲɛ solofere, kike senni, a naxa mangɛya raba Darisalamu ɲɛ tongo saxan nun saxan.<verse eid="1CH 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 3:5" />Di naani nan ya a naxee sɔtɔ Darisalamu Amiyɛli xa di ginɛ Batiseba ra: Simeya, Sobabo, Natan, Sulemani. <verse eid="1CH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 3:6" />Dawuda xa di solomanaanie nan ya: Yibixari, Elisuwa, Elifeleti, <verse eid="1CH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 3:7" />Noga, Nefegi, Yafiya, <verse eid="1CH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 3:8" />Elisama, Eliyada, nun Elifeleti. <verse eid="1CH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 3:9" />Dawuda xa die, a naxee sɔtɔ konyi ginɛe saabui ra mu na yi die ya ma. Tamari findi e maaginɛ nan na.<verse eid="1CH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudaya Mangɛe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 3:10" />Sulemani naxa Robowami sɔtɔ. Robowami naxa Abiya sɔtɔ. Abiya naxa Asa sɔtɔ. Asa naxa Yehosafati sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 3:11" />Yehosafati naxa Yorami sɔtɔ. Yorami naxa Axasiya sɔtɔ. Axasiya naxa Yowasi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 3:12" />Yowasi naxa Amasiya sɔtɔ. Amasiya naxa Asaraya sɔtɔ. Asaraya naxa Yotami sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 3:13" />Yotami naxa Axasi sɔtɔ. Axasi naxa Xesekiya sɔtɔ. Xesekiya naxa Manasi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 3:14" />Manasi naxa Amon sɔtɔ. Amon naxa Yosiya sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 3:15" />Yosiya xa di singe naxa findi Yoxanan na, a xa di firin nde, Yehoyakimi, a xa di saxan nde, Sidekiya, nun a xa di naani nde, Salumu. <verse eid="1CH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 3:16" />Yehoyakimi naxa Yekoniya nun Sidekiya sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudaya Mangɛe xɔrɛya sɔtɔ xanbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 3:17" />Mangɛ Yekoniya naxan nu na konyiya kui, a xa die nan ya: Salatiyeli, <verse eid="1CH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 3:18" />Malakirami, Pɛdaya, Seenasari, Yekamiya, Hosama, nun Nedabiya. <verse eid="1CH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 3:19" />Pɛdaya xa die nan ya: Sorobabeli nun Simeyi. Sorobabeli xa die nan ya: Mesulama nun Xananiya. Selomiti naxa findi e maaginɛ ra. <verse eid="1CH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 3:20" />Pɛdaya xa di suuli booree nan ya: Xasuba, Oheli, Berekiya, Xasadiya, nun Yusabi Xeseda. <verse eid="1CH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 3:21" />Xananiya xa die nan ya: Pɛlataya, Yɛsaya, Rɛfaya xa die, Aranan xa die, Abadiyasi xa die, Sɛkanaya xa die. <verse eid="1CH 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 3:22" />Sɛkanaya xa di findi Semaya nan na. Semaya xa die nan ya: Xatusi, Yigali, Bariya, Neyaraya, nun Safati, e birin nalanxi mixi senni. <verse eid="1CH 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 3:23" />Neyaraya xa die nan ya: Eliyowenayi, Xisikiya, nun Asirikama, e birin nalanxi mixi saxan. <verse eid="1CH 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 3:24" />Eliyowenayi xa die nan ya: Hodafiya, Eliyasibu, Pɛlaya, Akubu, Yoxanan, Dɛlaya, nun Anani, e birin nalanxi mixi solofere.<verse eid="1CH 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CH 4" />
  <para style="s">Yuda xabilɛe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 4:1" />Yuda xa die nan ya: Peresi, Xesiron, Karimi, Xuru nun Sobali. <verse eid="1CH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 4:2" />Sobali xa di Reyaya naxa Yaxati sɔtɔ. Yaxati naxa Axumayi nun Lahadi sɔtɔ. Soreyatakae xabilɛe fatanxi nee nan na. <verse eid="1CH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 4:3" />Etami xa die nan ya: Yisireeli, Yisema, nun Yidibasi. E maaginɛ xili Haseleliponi. <verse eid="1CH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 4:4" />Penuweli findi Gedori baba nan na. Eseri naxa findi Xusa baba ra. Yi mixie fatanxi Xuru nan na, Efarata xa di singe, Bɛtɛlɛɛmu baba. <verse eid="1CH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 4:5" />Tekowa baba Asexuri naxa ginɛ firin dɔxɔ, Xela nun Nayara. <verse eid="1CH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 4:6" />Nayara naxa Axusami, Xeferi, Temeni, nun Axasetari bari Asexuri bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 4:7" />Xela naxa Sɛrɛti, Soxara, Etenani, nun Kosi bari a bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 4:8" />Kosi naxa Anubi nun Sobeba sɔtɔ, a nun Harumi xa di Axaraxeli xabilɛe.<verse eid="1CH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 4:9" />Yabɛsi naxa binyɛ sɔtɔ dangife a ngaxakerenyie birin na. A nga naxa a xili sa Yabɛsi barima a a sɔtɔ tɔɔrɛ nan kui. <verse eid="1CH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 4:10" />Yabɛsi naxa Isirayila Marigi Ala maxandi, «I xa barakɛ sa n ma, i xa n ma bɔxi xun masa, i xa n mali i sɛnbɛ ra, i xa n natanga tɔɔrɛ ma.» Ala naxa a xa dubɛ suxu.<verse eid="1CH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 4:11" />Suuxa ngaxakerenyi Kelubu naxa Mexiri sɔtɔ. Mexiri naxa Eseton sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 4:12" />Eseton naxa Beti Rafa, Paseya, nun Texinna sɔtɔ. Texinna naxa Iri Naxasa sɔtɔ. Yi mixie findixi Rekakae nan na.<verse eid="1CH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 4:13" />Kenasi xa die nan ya: Otiniyeli nun Seraya. Otiniyeli xa die nan ya: Xatati nun Meyonotayi. <verse eid="1CH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 4:14" />Meyonotayi naxa Ofara sɔtɔ. Seraya naxa Yowaba sɔtɔ, naxan findi xabuie baba ra naxee nu na Xabuie xa gulunba. <verse eid="1CH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 4:15" />Yefune xa di Kalebi xa die nan ya: Iru, Ela, nun Naami. Ela naxa Kenasi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 4:16" />Yehaleleli xa die nan ya: Sifi, Sifa, Tiriya, nun Asareeli. <verse eid="1CH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 4:17" />Esira xa die nan ya: Yeteri, Meredi, Efere, nun Yalon. Meredi xa ginɛ nde naxa Mariyama, Samayi, nun Yiseba bari. Yiseba naxa findi Esitemowa baba ra. <verse eid="1CH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 4:18" />Meredi xa ginɛ Yudayaka xa die nan ya: Gedori baba Yeredi, Soko baba Xeberi, Sanowa baba Yekutiyeli. Firawuna xa di Bitiya, naxan nu bara dɔxɔ Meredi xɔn ma, na nan na die bari. <verse eid="1CH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 4:19" />Hodiya xa ginɛ, Naxami maaginɛ, naxa Keyila baba Garimika sɔtɔ, a nun Esitemowa Maakaka. <verse eid="1CH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 4:20" />Simon xa die nan ya: Aminon, Rinna, Ben Xanan, nun Tilon. Yiseyi naxa Soxeti nun Ben Soxeti sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 4:21" />Yuda xa di Sela xa die nan ya: Leka baba Eri, Maresa baba Laada, Asibeya xabilɛ naxee dugi yailanma, <verse eid="1CH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 4:22" />Yokimi, Kosebakae, Yowasi, nun Sarafi, naxan Mowaba nun Yasubi Lɛxɛmi yaamari kabi tɛmui xɔnnakuye. <verse eid="1CH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 4:23" />E tan nan nu fɛɲɛ yailanma mangɛ bɛ Netayimi nun Gedera taae kui e nu sabatixi dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="1CH 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simeyɔn xa die</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 4:24" />Simeyɔn xa die nan ya: Nemuweli, Yamin, Yaribu, Sera, nun Sawulu. <verse eid="1CH 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 4:25" />Sawulu naxa Salumu sɔtɔ. Salumu naxa Mibisami sɔtɔ. Mibisami naxa Misema sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 4:26" />Misema naxa Xamuwɛli sɔtɔ. Xamuwɛli naxa Sakuru sɔtɔ. Sakuru naxa Simeyi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 4:27" />Simeyi naxa di xɛmɛ fu nun senni nun di ginɛ senni sɔtɔ. A ngaxakerenyie mu di gbegbe sɔtɔ. E xabilɛe mu wuya alɔ Yuda bɔnsɔɛ. <verse eid="1CH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 4:28" />E sabatixi Beriseeba, Molada, Xasari Suwali, <verse eid="1CH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 4:29" />Bila, Esemi, Toladi, <verse eid="1CH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 4:30" />Betuweli, Horoma, Sikilaga, <verse eid="1CH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 4:31" />Beti Marakaboti, Xasari Susimi, Beti Biri, nun Saarayimi. E naxa lu na taae kui han Dawuda xa mangɛya tɛmui. <verse eid="1CH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 4:32" />E man nu na Etami, Ayin, Rimɔn, Token, nun Asan, na taa suuli <verse eid="1CH 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 4:33" />nun e rabilinyi han Baalati. E xa bɔxie nun e benbae nan na ki.<verse eid="1CH 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 4:34" />Simeyɔn bɔnsɔɛ xunyie nan ya: Mesobabo, Yameleki, Amasiya xa di Yosa, <verse eid="1CH 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 4:35" />Yoweli, Yosibiya xa di Yehu, Asiyeli xa di Seraya, <verse eid="1CH 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 4:36" />Eliyowenayi, Yaakoba, Yesohaya, Asaya, Adiyeli, Yesimiyeli, Bɛnaya, <verse eid="1CH 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 4:37" />nun Sisa, Sifeyi xa di, Alon xa di, Yɛdaya xa di, Simiri xa di, Semaya xa di.<verse eid="1CH 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 4:38" />Xabilɛe mangɛe nan na ki. E xa denbayae naxa wuya ki fanyi ra. <verse eid="1CH 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 4:39" />E naxa siga han Gedori gulunba sogetede ɲooge yire fende e xa xurusee bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 4:40" />E naxa fiili fanyie to naa. A belebele, mixi yo mu nu na. Singe Hami bɔnsɔɛ nan nu na mɛnni. <verse eid="1CH 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 4:41" />Yudaya mangɛ Xesekiya xa waxati kui, yi mixi naxee xili sɛbɛxi, e naxa siga naa, e banxie birin kana, e mɛnnikae ratɔn alako e xa sabati na, ɲooge fanyi nu na dɛnnaxɛ e xa xurusee bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 4:42" />Simeyɔn bɔnsɔɛ mixi kɛmɛ suuli naxa siga Seyiri geyae yire. E xa yareratie findi Yiseyi xa die nan na, Pɛlataya, Neyaraya, Rɛfaya, nun Yusiyɛli. <verse eid="1CH 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 4:43" />E to gɛ Amalɛkikae bɔnbɔde, naxee nu luxi naa, e naxa sabati mɛnni. Han to e bɔnsɔɛe na naa.<verse eid="1CH 4:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CH 5" />
  <para style="s">Ruben xa die</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 5:1" />Isirayila xa di singe findi Ruben nan na, kɔnɔ di singe tide naxa ba a yi ra, a so Isirayila xa di Yusufu xa die yi ra, barima Ruben nu bara a baba xa ginɛ kolon ginɛ ra. <verse eid="1CH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 5:2" />Yuda naxa sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ a ngaxakerenyie tagi han mangɛya naxa lu a bɔnsɔɛ yi, kɔnɔ di singe tide tan naxa lu Yusufu xa die yi.<verse eid="1CH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 5:3" />Isirayila xa di singe Ruben xa die nan ya: Xanɔki, Palu, Xesiron, nun Karimi. <verse eid="1CH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 5:4" />Yoweli bɔnsɔɛ nan ya: Semaya naxa Gogo sɔtɔ. Gogo naxa Simeyi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 5:5" />Simeyi naxa Mike sɔtɔ. Mike naxa Reyaya sɔtɔ. Reyaya naxa Bali sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 5:6" />Bali naxa Bɛɛra sɔtɔ. Asiriya mangɛ Tigilati Pileseri naxa Ruben bɔnsɔɛ mangɛdi Bɛɛra xanin konyiya kui.<verse eid="1CH 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 5:7" />Bɛɛra ngaxakerenyie nan ya, e xabilɛ ki ma: Yeyiyeli, Sakari, <verse eid="1CH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 5:8" />nun Bela, Asasi xa di, Sema xa di, Yoweli xa di. E naxa sabati bɔxi ma fɔlɔfe Aroweri sa dɔxɔ Nebo nun Bali Meyoni ra. <verse eid="1CH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 5:9" />E nu sabatixi gbengberenyi fɔlɛ ma, han Efirati xure ra. Xuruse gbegbe nu na e yi ra Galadi bɔxi ma. <verse eid="1CH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 5:10" />Mangɛ Sɔlu xa waxati kui, Ruben bɔnsɔɛ naxa Hagarikae gere, naxee nu na Galadi naaninyi sogetede biri.<verse eid="1CH 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gadi xa die</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 5:11" />Gadi bɔnsɔɛ nun Ruben bɔnsɔɛ sabatixi e boore nan ya i Basan bɔxi kui, han Salaka. <verse eid="1CH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 5:12" />E xilie nan ya: Yoweli, mixi singe, Safami, a firin nde, Yaanayi, nun Safati naxee nu na Basan bɔxi ma. <verse eid="1CH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 5:13" />E xunya solofere nan ya: Mikayeli, Mesulama, Seeba, Yorayi, Yakan, Siya, nun Eberi. <verse eid="1CH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 5:14" />Abixayili xa die nan na ki, Xuri xa di, Yarowa xa di, Galadi xa di, Mikayeli xa di, Yesisayi xa di, Yado xa di, Busi xa di. <verse eid="1CH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 5:15" />Abidiyeli xa di Axi, Guni xa mamadi, e naxa findi e xabilɛe xunyi ra. <verse eid="1CH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 5:16" />E sabatixi Galadi, Basan, na rabilinyi, han Sarɔn naaninyie ra. <verse eid="1CH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 5:17" />Yudaya mangɛ Yotami nun Isirayila mangɛ Yerobowami naxa e xilie sɛbɛ.<verse eid="1CH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 5:18" />Ruben bɔnsɔɛ, Gadi bɔnsɔɛ, nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti keren, e xa sɔɔri xasabi sigama han mixi wulu tongo naani nun naani, mixi kɛmɛ solofere tongo senni. E birin fata gere sode. Makantase, santidɛgɛma, nun xali nu na e yi ra. <verse eid="1CH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 5:19" />E naxa Hagarikae, Yeturikae, Nafisikae, nun Nodabokae gere. <verse eid="1CH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 5:20" />Ala naxa xun nakeli fi e ma Hagarikae xun ma, barima e nu bara Ala maxandi gere kui. Ala naxa e xa duba suxu barima e laxi a ra. <verse eid="1CH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 5:21" />E naxa e yaxuie xa xurusee ba e yi: ɲɔxɔmɛ wulu tongo suuli, yɛxɛɛ nun si wulu kɛmɛ firin tongo suuli, nun sofale wulu firin. E naxa mixi wulu kɛmɛ fan suxu. <verse eid="1CH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 5:22" />E e yaxui gbegbe faxa nɛ barima na gere kelixi Ala yati nan ma. E naxa sabati naa han e siga konyiya kui tɛmui naxɛ.<verse eid="1CH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti keren</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 5:23" />Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti keren sabatixi bɔxi nan ma naxan fɔlɔxi Basan han Bali Xerimon, sa dɔxɔ Seniri, nun Xerimon geya ra. E wuya. <verse eid="1CH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 5:24" />E xa denbaya mangɛe nan ya: Efere, Yiseyi, Eliyeli, Asiriyɛli, Yeremi, Hodafiya, nun Yaxadiyeli. Yi denbaya mangɛe sɛnbɛ gbo, naafuli gbegbe na e yi. <verse eid="1CH 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 5:25" />Kɔnɔ e naxa e babae Marigi Ala yanfa, e mɛnnikae xa kuyee batu, Ala nɔ naxee ra a singe. <verse eid="1CH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 5:26" />Na kui Ala naxa a niya, Asiriya Mangɛe Pulu nun Tigilati Pileseri bɔɲɛ xa te, e fa Ruben bɔnsɔɛ, Gadi bɔnsɔɛ, nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ tagi xanin Xala, Xaboro, nun Hara, han Gosan xure e na dɛnnaxɛ han to. <verse eid="1CH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 5:27" />Lewi xa die nan ya: Gerison, Kehati, nun Merari. <verse eid="1CH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 5:28" />Kehati xa die nan ya: Amarama, Yisehari, Xebiron, nun Yusiyɛli. <verse eid="1CH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 5:29" />Amarama di xɛmɛ firin nan sɔtɔ, Haruna nun Munsa, a nun di ginɛ keren, Mariyama. Haruna xa die nan ya: Nadabo, Abihu, Eleyasari, nun Itamari. <verse eid="1CH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 5:30" />Eleyasari naxa Finexasi sɔtɔ. Finexasi naxa Abisuwa sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 5:31" />Abisuwa naxa Buuki sɔtɔ. Buuki naxa Usi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 5:32" />Usi naxa Sɛraxaya sɔtɔ. Sɛraxaya naxa Merayoti sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 5:33" />Merayoti naxa Amaraya sɔtɔ. Amaraya naxa Axituba sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 5:34" />Axituba naxa Sadɔki sɔtɔ. Sadɔki naxa Aximaasi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 5:35" />Aximaasi naxa Asaraya sɔtɔ. Asaraya naxa Yoxanan sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 5:36" />Yoxanan naxa Asaraya sɔtɔ, naxan findi sɛrɛxɛdubɛ ra Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui Sulemani naxan tixi Darisalamu. <verse eid="1CH 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 5:37" />Asaraya naxa Amaraya sɔtɔ. Amaraya naxa Axituba sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 5:38" />Axituba naxa Sadɔki sɔtɔ. Sadɔki naxa Salumu sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 5:39" />Salumu naxa Xilikiya sɔtɔ. Xilikiya naxa Asaraya sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 5:40" />Asaraya naxa Seraya sɔtɔ. Seraya naxa Yehosadaki sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 5:41" />Alatala to Yudaya nun Darisalamu xanin konyiya kui, Nebukadansari naxa Yehosadaki xanin a xun ma.<verse eid="1CH 5:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CH 6" />
  <para style="s">Lewi xa die</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 6:1" />Lewi xa die nan ya: Gerison, Kehati, nun Merari. <verse eid="1CH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 6:2" />Gerison ma die nan ya: Libini nun Simeyi. <verse eid="1CH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 6:3" />Kehati xa die nan ya: Amarama, Yisehari, Xebiron, nun Yusiyɛli. <verse eid="1CH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 6:4" />Merari xa die nan ya: Maxali nun Musi.<verse eid="1CH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 6:5" />Lewi bɔnsɔɛe babae nan ya: Gerison naxa Libini sɔtɔ. Libini naxa Yaxati sɔtɔ. Yaxati naxa Sima sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 6:6" />Sima naxa Yowa sɔtɔ. Yowa naxa Ido sɔtɔ. Ido naxa Sera sɔtɔ. Sera naxa Yeyaterayi sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 6:7" />Kehati xa die nan ya: Kehati naxa Aminadabo sɔtɔ. Aminadabo naxa Kora sɔtɔ. Kora naxa Asiri sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 6:8" />Asiri naxa Elekana sɔtɔ. Elekana naxa Ebiyasafi sɔtɔ. Ebiyasafi naxa Asiri sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 6:9" />Asiri naxa Taxati sɔtɔ. Taxati naxa Uriyeli sɔtɔ. Uriyeli naxa Yusiya sɔtɔ. Yusiya naxa Sawulu sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 6:10" />Elekana xa die nan ya: Amasayi nun Aximoti. <verse eid="1CH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 6:11" />Elekana naxa Sofayi sɔtɔ. Sofayi naxa Naxati sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 6:12" />Naxati naxa Eliyabi sɔtɔ. Eliyabi naxa Yeroxama sɔtɔ. Yeroxama naxa Elekana sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 6:13" />Elekana naxa Samuweli sɔtɔ. Samuweli xa die nan ya: Yoweli, a xa di singe, nun Abiya. <verse eid="1CH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 6:14" />Merari xa die nan ya: Merari naxa Maxali sɔtɔ. Maxali naxa Libini sɔtɔ. Libini naxa Simeyi sɔtɔ. Simeyi naxa Usa sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 6:15" />Usa naxa Simeya sɔtɔ. Simeya naxa Xagiya sɔtɔ. Xagiya naxa Asaya sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bɛɛtibae Dawuda xa waxati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 6:16" />Saatɛ kankira to dɔxɔ Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira kui, Dawuda naxa bɛɛtibae sugandi naxee bɛɛti bama. <verse eid="1CH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 6:17" />Singe e nu bɛɛti bama Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira nan ya ra, Kiri Banxi Naralande. E naxa na wali raba mɛnni han mangɛ Sulemani Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi tixi Darisalamu tɛmui naxɛ.<verse eid="1CH 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 6:18" />Bɛɛtibae xilie nan ya a nun e xa die: Kehati xabilɛ ya ma, Heman bɛɛtiba, Yoweli xa di, Samuweli xa di, <verse eid="1CH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 6:19" />Elekana xa di, Yeroxama xa di, Eliyeli xa di, Towa xa di, <verse eid="1CH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 6:20" />Sufu xa di, Elekana xa di, Maxati xa di, Amasayi xa di, <verse eid="1CH 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 6:21" />Elekana xa di, Yoweli xa di, Asaraya xa di, Sefaniya xa di, <verse eid="1CH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 6:22" />Taxati xa di, Asiri xa di, Ebiyasafi xa di, Kora xa di, <verse eid="1CH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 6:23" />Yisehari xa di, Kehati xa di, Lewi xa di, Isirayila xa di.<verse eid="1CH 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 6:24" />Heman malima, naxan nu tixi a yirefanyi ma, na findi Asafi nan na, Berekiya xa di, Simeya xa di, <verse eid="1CH 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 6:25" />Mikayeli xa di, Baaseya xa di, Malakiya xa di, <verse eid="1CH 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 6:26" />Etini xa di, Sera xa di, Adaya xa di, <verse eid="1CH 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 6:27" />Etani xa di, Sima xa di, Simeyi xa di, <verse eid="1CH 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 6:28" />Yaxati xa di, Gerison ma di, Lewi xa di.<verse eid="1CH 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 6:29" />Naxee kelixi Merari xabilɛ ya ma, nee nu tima kɔɔla nan ma. E xunyi findi Etani nan na, Kisi xa di, Abidi xa di, Maluku xa di, <verse eid="1CH 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 6:30" />Xasabiya xa di, Amasiya xa di, Xilikiya xa di, <verse eid="1CH 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 6:31" />Amasi xa di, Bani xa di, Semeri xa di, <verse eid="1CH 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 6:32" />Maxali xa di, Musi xa di, Merari xa di, Lewi xa di.<verse eid="1CH 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 6:33" />E ngaxakerenyie Lewi bɔnsɔɛ ya ma, nu na Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira wali kui. <verse eid="1CH 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 6:34" />Haruna nun a xa die naxa sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ba sɛrɛxɛbade fari, e man surayi gan sɛrɛxɛ ra surayi sɛrɛxɛbade fari. E na wali birin naba yire sɛniyɛnxi fisamante nan kui naxan findi Isirayila xunsare ra, alɔ Ala xa konyi Munsa a masenxi ki naxɛ.<verse eid="1CH 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 6:35" />Haruna xa die nan ya: Eleyasari, a xa di Finexasi, a xa di Abisuwa, <verse eid="1CH 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 6:36" />a xa di Buuki, a xa di Usi, a xa di Sɛraxaya, <verse eid="1CH 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 6:37" />a xa di Merayoti, a xa di Amaraya, a xa di Axituba, <verse eid="1CH 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 6:38" />a xa di Sadɔki, a xa di Aximaasi.<verse eid="1CH 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lewi bɔnsɔɛ xa taae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JOS 21:1-42">Yosuwe 21:1-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 6:39" />E xa taae nan ya e sabatixi dɛnnaxɛ: Haruna xa die, naxee kelixi Kehati xabilɛ ya ma, nee nan singe bɔxi sɔtɔ Ala xa maragiri kui. <verse eid="1CH 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 6:40" />Xebiron nun a rabilinyie naxa findi e gbe ra, Yudaya bɔxi ma, <verse eid="1CH 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 6:41" />kɔnɔ Xebiron daaxa nun taa naxee nu na na rabilinyi, nee naxa findi Yefune xa di Kalebi gbe ra. <verse eid="1CH 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 6:42" />Haruna xa die naxa Xebiron sɔtɔ, naxan findixi mixi ratanga taa ra, e naxa Libina nun a rabilinyi, Yatiri, Esitemowa nun a rabilinyi sɔtɔ, <verse eid="1CH 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 6:43" />e naxa Xilen nun a rabilinyi, Debiri nun a rabilinyi, <verse eid="1CH 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 6:44" />Asan nun a rabilinyi, Beti Semesi nun a rabilinyi fan sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 6:45" />E taa naxee sɔtɔ Bunyamin bɔxi ma nee nan ya: Gabayon, Geba, a rabilinyi, Alemeti, a rabilinyi, Anatɔti, nun a rabilinyi. E naxa taa fu nun saxan sɔtɔ e xabilɛ ki ma. <verse eid="1CH 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 6:46" />Kehati xa di booree naxa taa fu sɔtɔ Ala xa maragiri kui Efirami bɔnsɔɛ, Dana bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti keren, nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti keren xa bɔxie ma. <verse eid="1CH 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 6:47" />Gerison ma die naxa taa fu nun saxan sɔtɔ e xabilɛ ki ma Isakari bɔnsɔɛ, Aseri bɔnsɔɛ, Nafatali bɔnsɔɛ, nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti keren xa bɔxie ma naxee nu na Basan bɔxi ma. <verse eid="1CH 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 6:48" />Merari xa die naxa taa fu nun firin sɔtɔ Ala xa maragiri kui Ruben bɔnsɔɛ, Gadi bɔnsɔɛ, nun Sabulon bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxie ma.<verse eid="1CH 6:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 6:49" />Isirayilakae taae nun e rabilinyie fi Lewi bɔnsɔɛ ma na ki nɛ. <verse eid="1CH 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 6:50" />E naxa na taae fi e ma Ala xa maragiri kui, taa naxee nu na Yuda, Simeyɔn, nun Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛe xa bɔxie ma. <verse eid="1CH 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 6:51" />Kehati xabilɛ booree naxa taae sɔtɔ Efirami bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi ma. <verse eid="1CH 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 6:52" />E naxa mixi ratanga taa Sikemi nun a rabilinyi fi e ma Efirami geya ma, a nun Geseri, a rabilinyi, <verse eid="1CH 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 6:53" />Yokineyami, a rabilinyi, Beti Xoron, a rabilinyi, <verse eid="1CH 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 6:54" />Ayalon, a rabilinyi, Gati Rimɔn, nun a rabilinyi. <verse eid="1CH 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 6:55" />E naxa Aneri, a rabilinyi, Bileyami, nun a rabilinyi sɔtɔ Manasi bɔnsɔɛ tagi xa bɔxi ma. Kehati xabilɛ booree xa taae nan na ki.<verse eid="1CH 6:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CH 6:56" />Gerison ma die xa taae nan ya: Golan, a rabilinyi, naxan na Basan bɔxi ma, Asataroti, a rabilinyi, naxee na Manasi bɔnsɔɛ tagi xa bɔxi ma, <verse eid="1CH 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CH 6:57" />Kadesi, a rabilinyi, Daberati, a rabilinyi, <verse eid="1CH 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CH 6:58" />Ramoti, a rabilinyi, Anemi, a rabilinyi, naxee na Isakari bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi ma. <verse eid="1CH 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1CH 6:59" />E xa taa naxee na Aseri bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi ma nee nan ya: Masala, a rabilinyi, Abadon, a rabilinyi, <verse eid="1CH 6:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1CH 6:60" />Hukoki, a rabilinyi, Rexobo, nun a rabilinyi. <verse eid="1CH 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1CH 6:61" />E xa taa naxee na Nafatali bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi ma, nee nan ya: Kadesi naxan na Galile bɔxi ma, Xamɔn, a rabilinyi, Kiriyatayimi nun a rabilinyi.<verse eid="1CH 6:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1CH 6:62" />Merari xa die xa taae nan ya: Rimono, a rabilinyi, Taboro, a rabilinyi, naxee na Sabulon bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi ma. <verse eid="1CH 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1CH 6:63" />E xa taa naxee na Ruben bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi ma Yurudɛn naakiri ma Yeriko ya ra, nee nan ya: Beteseri naxan na gbengberenyi ma, a rabilinyi, Yahasa, a rabilinyi, <verse eid="1CH 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="1CH 6:64" />Kedemoti, a rabilinyi, Mefaati, a rabilinyi. <verse eid="1CH 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="1CH 6:65" />E xa taa naxee na Gadi bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi ma, nee nan ya: Ramoti naxan na Galadi bɔxi ma, a rabilinyi, Maxanayimi, a rabilinyi, <verse eid="1CH 6:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="1CH 6:66" />Xɛsibɔn, a rabilinyi, Yaasɛri, nun a rabilinyi.<verse eid="1CH 6:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CH 7" />
  <para style="s">Isakari xa die</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 7:1" />Isakari xa di naani nan ya: Tola, Puwa, Yasubu, nun Simiron. <verse eid="1CH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 7:2" />Tola xa die nan ya: Usi, Rɛfaya, Yeriyeli, Yamayi, Yibisami, nun Samuweli. Yi mixie nan findixi e xabilɛ mangɛe ra. Mangɛ Dawuda xa waxati kui, Tola xa di mixi wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin, kɛmɛ senni findi sɔɔrie nan na. <verse eid="1CH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 7:3" />Usi xa di xili Yisiraxiya. Yisiraxiya xa die nan ya: Mikayeli, Abadiyasi, Yoweli, nun Yisiya. Yi mixi suuli nan findi e xabilɛ mangɛe ra. <verse eid="1CH 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 7:4" />Usi xa mixi wulu tongo saxan nun senni findi sɔɔrie nan na, barima e xa ginɛe nun e xa die wuya. <verse eid="1CH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 7:5" />Isakari xabilɛe birin ya ma, xɛmɛ mixi wulu tongo solomasaxan nun solofere findi sɔɔri gbangbalanyie nan na.<verse eid="1CH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bunyamin xa die</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 7:6" />Bunyamin xa die nan ya: Bela, Bekeri, nun Yediyayeli. <verse eid="1CH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 7:7" />Bela xa di suuli nan ya: Esibon, Usi, Yusiyɛli, Yerimoti, nun Yiri. Yi mixie nan findi e xabilɛ mangɛe ra. Sɔɔri gbangbalanyi mixi wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin, tongo saxan nun naani nu na e ya ma. <verse eid="1CH 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 7:8" />Bekeri xa die nan ya: Semira, Yowasi, Eliyeseri, Eliyowenayi, Omeri, Yeremoti, Abiya, Anatɔti, nun Alemeti. Yee birin Bekeri xa die nan e ra. <verse eid="1CH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 7:9" />E xabilɛe xunyie xilie sɛbɛxi, e sɔɔri mixi wulu mɔxɔɲɛn kɛmɛ firin nu na. <verse eid="1CH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 7:10" />Yediyayeli xa di xili Bilihan. Bilihan xa die nan ya: Yeyusu, Bunyamin, Exudu, Kenaana, Setani, Tarasisi, nun Axisaxari. <verse eid="1CH 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 7:11" />Yediyayeli xa die birin findi e xabilɛe xunyie nan na. Sɔɔri mixi wulu fu nun solofere kɛmɛ firin nu na e ya ma. <verse eid="1CH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 7:12" />Iri xa die nan ya: Supimi nun Xupimi. Axeri xa di xili Xusimi.<verse eid="1CH 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nafatali xa die</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 7:13" />Nafatali xa die nan ya: Yaxaseeli, Guni, Yeseri, nun Salumu, Bila xa di.<verse eid="1CH 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manasi xa die</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 7:14" />Manasi xa die nan ya: A xa konyi ginɛ naxan kelixi Siriya bɔxi ma naxa Asirɛli nun Makiri bari a bɛ. Makiri naxa Galadi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 7:15" />Makiri naxa ginɛ fen Xupimi nun Supimi bɛ. Makiri maaginɛ xili Maaka. Makiri xa di firin nde xili Selofexadi. Selofexadi mu di xɛmɛ yo sɔtɔ, fo di ginɛe. <verse eid="1CH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 7:16" />Makiri xa ginɛ Maaka naxa di bari, a xili sa Peresi xun ma. A xunya xili Seresi. Peresi xa die nan ya: Ulami nun Rakemi. <verse eid="1CH 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 7:17" />Ulami xa di xili Bedan. Galadi xa die nan na ki, Makiri xa di, Manasi xa di. <verse eid="1CH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 7:18" />Galadi maaginɛ Hamoleketi xa die nan ya: Isihodi, Abiyeseri, nun Maxala. <verse eid="1CH 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 7:19" />Sɛmida xa die nan ya: Axiyani, Sikemi, Likixi, nun Aniyama.<verse eid="1CH 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Efirami xa die</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 7:20" />Efirami xa die nan ya: Efirami naxa Sutela sɔtɔ. Sutela naxa Bereda sɔtɔ. Bereda naxa Taxati sɔtɔ. Taxati naxa Eleyada sɔtɔ. Eleyada naxa Taxati sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 7:21" />Taxati naxa Sabadi sɔtɔ. Sabadi naxa Sutela sɔtɔ. Gatikae naxa Eseri nun Eleyadi faxa nee to siga e xa xurusee muɲade. Eseri nun Eleyadi bari mɛnni nɛ. <verse eid="1CH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 7:22" />E baba Efirami naxa sunnun tɛmui xɔnkuye. E ngaxakerenyie naxa a madundu. <verse eid="1CH 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 7:23" />Na dangi xanbi a xa ginɛ naxa tɛɛgɛ. A to di bari, a naxa a xili sa Beriya barima tɔɔrɛ nu bara gbo a xɔnyi. <verse eid="1CH 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 7:24" />A naxa di ginɛ sɔtɔ naxan xili Seera. Na naxa Beti Xoron Labe nun Beti Xoron Fuge ti, a nun taa gbɛtɛ naxan xili Useni Seera. <verse eid="1CH 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 7:25" />Efirami naxa Refa sɔtɔ. Refa naxa Resefa sɔtɔ. Resefa naxa Tela sɔtɔ. Tela naxa Taxani sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 7:26" />Taxani naxa Ladana sɔtɔ. Ladana naxa Amixudi sɔtɔ. Amixudi naxa Elisama sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 7:27" />Elisama naxa Nunu sɔtɔ. Nunu naxa Yosuwe sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 7:28" />E naxa sabati Beteli nun a rabilinyi, Naarani, a sogetede, Geseri nun a rabilinyi, a sogegorode, Sikemi nun a rabilinyi, han Aya nun a rabilinyi. <verse eid="1CH 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 7:29" />Manasi bɔnsɔɛ xa taae nan ya: Beti Saan, a rabilinyi, Taanaki, a rabilinyi, Megido, a rabilinyi, Dɔrɔ, nun a rabilinyi. Isirayila xa di Yusufu bɔnsɔɛ sabatixi yi taae nan kui.<verse eid="1CH 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aseri xa die</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 7:30" />Aseri xa die nan ya: Yimina, Yisiwa, Yisiwi, nun Beriya. E maaginɛ xili Sera. <verse eid="1CH 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 7:31" />Beriya xa die nan ya: Xeberi nun Malakiyeli, naxan findi Birisafiti baba ra. <verse eid="1CH 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 7:32" />Xeberi xa die nan ya: Yefeleti, Someri, nun Xotama. E maaginɛ xili Suwa. <verse eid="1CH 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 7:33" />Yefeleti xa die nan ya: Pasaki, Bimali, nun Asefati. Yefeleti xa die nan na ki. <verse eid="1CH 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 7:34" />Someri xa die nan ya: Axi, Roga, Xuba, nun Arami. <verse eid="1CH 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 7:35" />Someri xunya Helemi xa die nan ya: Sofaxa, Yimena, Selesi, nun Amali. <verse eid="1CH 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 7:36" />Sofaxa xa die nan ya: Suwa, Xaraneferi, Suwali, Beri, Yimira, <verse eid="1CH 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 7:37" />Beteseri, Hodo, Saama, Silesa, Yitiran, nun Beera. <verse eid="1CH 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 7:38" />Yeteri xa die nan ya: Yefune, Pisepa, nun Ara. <verse eid="1CH 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 7:39" />Ula xa die nan ya: Ara, Xaniyɛli, nun Risiya. <verse eid="1CH 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 7:40" />Aseri xa die nan na ki, mangɛe, mixi xungbee, sɔɔrie gbangbalanyie, mangɛdie nan nu e ra e xabilɛe ya ma, naxee kɔnti siga han mixi wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun senni.<verse eid="1CH 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CH 8" />
  <para style="s">Bunyamin xa die</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 8:1" />Bunyamin xa die nan ya: Bela, a xa di singe, Asibeli, a xa di firin nde, Axara, a xa di saxan nde, <verse eid="1CH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 8:2" />Noxa, a xa di naani nde, nun Rafa, a xa di suuli nde. <verse eid="1CH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 8:3" />Bela xa die nan ya: Adari, Gera, Abihudi, <verse eid="1CH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 8:4" />Abisuwa, Naaman, Axowa, <verse eid="1CH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 8:5" />Gera, Sefufani, nun Xurami. <verse eid="1CH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 8:6" />Exudu xa die nan ya, naxee findi xabilɛ mangɛe ra: <verse eid="1CH 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 8:7" />Naaman, Ahiya, nun Gera. Singe e nu na Geba, kɔnɔ Gera naxa e xanin Manaxati. Gera naxa Usa nun Axixudi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 8:8" />Saxarayimi to mɛɛ a xa ginɛe Xusimi nun Baara ra, a naxa die sɔtɔ Mowaba bɔxi ma. <verse eid="1CH 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 8:9" />A xa ginɛ Xodesi xa die nan ya: Yobabo, Sibiya, Mesa, Malakama, Yeyusi, Sakiya, nun Mirima. <verse eid="1CH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 8:10" />A xa die nan na ki naxee findi xabilɛ mangɛe ra.<verse eid="1CH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 8:11" />A xa ginɛ Xusimi xa die nan ya: Abitubu nun Elipaali. <verse eid="1CH 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 8:12" />Elipaali xa die nan ya: Eberi, Misami, nun Semedi, naxan Ono, Lodi, nun e rabilinyi tixi.<verse eid="1CH 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 8:13" />Beriya nun Sema, naxee findi Ayalon xabilɛ mangɛe ra, naxa Gatikae keri. <verse eid="1CH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 8:14" />Beriya xa mixie nan ya: Axiyo, Sasaki, Yeremoti, <verse eid="1CH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 8:15" />Sebadaya, Aradi, Ederi, <verse eid="1CH 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 8:16" />Mikayeli, Yisepa, nun Yoxa. <verse eid="1CH 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 8:17" />Elipaali xa die nan ya: Sebadaya, Mesulama, Xisiki, Xeberi, <verse eid="1CH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 8:18" />Yisemerayi, Yisiliya, nun Yobabo. <verse eid="1CH 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 8:19" />Simeyi xa die nan ya: Yakimi, Sikiri, Sabidi, <verse eid="1CH 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 8:20" />Eliyenayi, Siletayi, Eliyeli, <verse eid="1CH 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 8:21" />Adaya, Bɛraya, nun Simirati. <verse eid="1CH 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 8:22" />Sasaki xa die nan ya: Yisepan, Eberi, Eliyeli, <verse eid="1CH 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 8:23" />Abadon, Sikiri, Xanan, <verse eid="1CH 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 8:24" />Xananiya, Elama, Antotiya, <verse eid="1CH 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 8:25" />Yifideya, nun Penuweli. <verse eid="1CH 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 8:26" />Yeroxama xa die nan ya: Sameserayi, Sexaraya, Atalaya, <verse eid="1CH 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 8:27" />Yaaresiya, Eliya, nun Sikiri. <verse eid="1CH 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 8:28" />Darisalamu xabilɛ mangɛe nan na ki.<verse eid="1CH 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 8:29" />Gabayon baba Yeyiyeli sabati Gabayon nɛ. A xa ginɛ xili Maaka. <verse eid="1CH 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 8:30" />A xa die nan ya: Abadon, a xa di singe, Suru, Kisu, Bali, Neri, Nadabo, <verse eid="1CH 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 8:31" />Gedori, Axiyo, Sekeri, <verse eid="1CH 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 8:32" />nun Mikiloti, naxan findi Simeyami baba ra. E fan sabati Darisalamu nɛ e bari mixie ya ma.<verse eid="1CH 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 8:33" />Neri naxa Kisu sɔtɔ. Kisu naxa Sɔlu sɔtɔ. Sɔlu xa die nan ya: Yonatan, Malakisuwa, Abinadabo, nun Esibaali. <verse eid="1CH 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 8:34" />Yonatan xa di xili Meribaali. Meribaali naxa Mike sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 8:35" />Mike xa die nan ya: Piton, Meleki, Tareya, nun Axasi. <verse eid="1CH 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 8:36" />Axasi naxa Yehowada sɔtɔ. Yehowada xa die nan ya: Alemeti, Asamafeti, nun Simiri. <verse eid="1CH 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 8:37" />Simiri naxa Mosa sɔtɔ. Mosa naxa Bineya sɔtɔ. Bineya naxa Rafa sɔtɔ. Rafa naxa Eleyasa sɔtɔ. Eleyasa naxa Aseli sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 8:38" />Aseli xa die nan ya: Asirikama, Bokeru, Sumayila, Seyaraya, Abadiyasi, nun Xanan. Aseli xa die nan na ki. <verse eid="1CH 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 8:39" />Aseli xunya Eseka xa die nan ya: Ulami, a xa di singe, Yeyusu, a xa di firin nde, nun Elifeleti a xa di saxan nde. <verse eid="1CH 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 8:40" />Ulami xa die sɔɔri gbangbalanyie nan nu e ra. E fata xali ra. E xa die nun mamadie wuya e kɔnti sigama han mixi kɛmɛ tongo suuli. Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ nan e birin na.<verse eid="1CH 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CH 9" />
  <para style="s">Darisalamukae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 9:1" />Isirayilakae xilie birin sɛbɛxi Isirayila mangɛe xa buki nde kui. <verse eid="1CH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 9:2" />Yuda bɔnsɔɛ nu bara siga konyiya kui Babilɔn bɔxi ma e xa yanfanteya xa fe ra. Naxee singe gbilen sabatide e xɔnyi Isirayila bɔxi ma, e findi Isirayila sɛrɛxɛdubɛe, Lewikae, nun mixie nan na, naxee walima Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui. <verse eid="1CH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 9:3" />Yuda bɔnsɔɛ, Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ, Efirami bɔnsɔɛ, nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ mixi ndee naxa sabati Darisalamu. <verse eid="1CH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 9:4" />Yuda bɔnsɔɛ xa mixi, naxee sabati Darisalamu, findi Utayi nan na, Amixudi xa di, Omeri xa di, Imiri xa di, Bani xa di, Peresi xa di, Yuda xa di. <verse eid="1CH 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 9:5" />Siloka naxee sabati naa, nee findi Asaya nan na, di singe, nun a xa die. <verse eid="1CH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 9:6" />Sera xa di naxee sabati naa, nee findi Yuwɛli, nun a ngaxakerenyie nan na, mixi kɛmɛ senni, mixi tongo solomanaani. <verse eid="1CH 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 9:7" />Bunyamin xa di naxee sabati naa, nee nan ya: Mesulama xa di Salu, Hasɛnuwa xa di, Hodafiya xa di, <verse eid="1CH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 9:8" />a nun Yeroxama xa di Yibineya, a nun Usi xa di Ela, Mikiri xa di, a nun Sɛfataya xa di Mesulama, Reyuweli xa di, Yibiniya xa di, <verse eid="1CH 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 9:9" />a nun e ngaxakerenyie e xabilɛ ki ma, mixi kɛmɛ solomanaani, mixi tongo suuli nun senni.<verse eid="1CH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 9:10" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ naxee sabatixi Darisalamu, nee nan ya: Yɛdaya, Yehoyaribu, Yakin, <verse eid="1CH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 9:11" />Xilikiya xa di Asaraya, Mesulama xa di, Sadɔki xa di, Merayoti xa di, Axituba xa di, naxan findi Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi wali xunyi ra, <verse eid="1CH 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 9:12" />Yeroxama xa di Adaya, Pasura xa di, Malakiya xa di, Masayi xa di, Adiyeli xa di, Yasera xa di, Mesulama xa di, Mesilemiti xa di, Imeri xa di, <verse eid="1CH 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 9:13" />a nun e ngaxakerenyie, e denbaya xunyie, mixi wulu keren, kɛmɛ solofere tongo senni. E birin findi kuntigie nan na, naxee walima Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui. <verse eid="1CH 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 9:14" />Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mixi naxee sabatixi Darisalamu, nee nan ya: Xasubu xa di Semaya, Asirikama xa di, Xasabiya xa di, Merarika, <verse eid="1CH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 9:15" />a nun Bakibakari, Xeresi, Galali, Mataniya, Mika xa di, Sikiri xa di, Asafi xa di, <verse eid="1CH 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 9:16" />a nun Semaya xa di Abadiyasi, Galali xa di, Yedutun xa di, a nun Asa xa di Berekiya, Elekana xa di, naxan sabatixi Netofakae xa taae kui.<verse eid="1CH 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 9:17" />Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi naadɛ makantɛe nan ya: Salumu, naxan findi e xunyi ra, Akubu, Talamɔn, Aximan, a nun e ngaxakerenyie. <verse eid="1CH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 9:18" />Salumu bɔnsɔɛ nan naadɛ makanta wali rabafe han to hɔrɔmɔbanxi sogetede biri ra. Naadɛ naxan xili «Mangɛ naadɛ.» E benbae findi nɛ naadɛ makantɛe ra Lewikae bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 9:19" />Salumu, Kore xa di, Ebiyasafi xa di, Kora xa di, a nun a ngaxakerenyi naxee findi naadɛ makantɛe ra, naxa Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira kanta alɔ e babae singe a raba ki naxɛ. <verse eid="1CH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 9:20" />Finexasi, Eleyasari xa di, nu findixi naadɛ makantɛe xunyi nan na. Alatala nu na a sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="1CH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 9:21" />Meselemiya xa di Sakari nu bara findi Kiri Banxi Naralande naadɛ makantɛ ra. <verse eid="1CH 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 9:22" />Mixi kɛmɛ firin, fu nun firin nu bara sugandi na wali rabade. E xili birin sɛbɛxi a nun taa xilie e sabatixi dɛnnaxɛ. Dawuda nun Annabi Samuweli nu bara na wali so e yi ra. <verse eid="1CH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 9:23" />E tan nun e xa die naxa Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira naadɛe kanta. <verse eid="1CH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 9:24" />Naadɛ makantɛ ndee nu tixi sogetede, sogegorode, kɔɔla, nun yirefanyi ma. <verse eid="1CH 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 9:25" />E ngaxakerenyi naxee nu na taae kui, e nu fama e malide xi solofere bun ma. <verse eid="1CH 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 9:26" />Naadɛ makantɛ kuntigie Lewikae, naxa yiree kanta Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui naafuli nu ragataxi dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="1CH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 9:27" />E nu xima Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi rabilinyi nɛ alako e xa mɛnni makanta, a nun e xa naadɛe rabi gɛɛsɛgɛ.<verse eid="1CH 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 9:28" />Lewika ndee nu yirabasee ragatama, e nu e ramini lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ, e man nu e kɔnti. <verse eid="1CH 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 9:29" />Booree nu yirabasee ragata, naxee nu na yire sɛniyɛnxi, a nun farin, wɛni, ture, surayi, nun se ɲɔxunmɛe. <verse eid="1CH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 9:30" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe xa die nu labundɛe masunbu. <verse eid="1CH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 9:31" />Salumu xa di Matitiya Lewika, naxan keli Kora xabilɛ ya ma, nu taami ganma naxan nu bama sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="1CH 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 9:32" />E ngaxakerenyi ndee, Kehati bɔnsɔɛ ya ma, nu taami dɔxɔma teebili ra malabui lɔxɔɛ birin. <verse eid="1CH 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 9:33" />Bɛɛtiba naxee findi Lewi xabilɛe xunyie ra, nu sabatixi Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi yigiyadee kui. Wali gbɛtɛ yo mu nu na e yi ra, barima e findi wali birin xunyi nan na. E nu walima kɔɛ nun yanyi. <verse eid="1CH 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 9:34" />Lewi xabilɛe xunyie nan na ki, naxee sabatixi Darisalamu.<verse eid="1CH 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sɔlu bɔnsɔɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 8:29-38">Isirayila Mangɛe I 8:29-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 9:35" />Gabayon baba Yeyiyeli nu sabatixi Gabayon taa nan kui. A xa ginɛ xili Maaka. <verse eid="1CH 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 9:36" />A xa di nan ya: Abadon, a xa di singe, Suru, Kisu, Bali, Neri, Nadabo, <verse eid="1CH 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 9:37" />Gedori, Axiyo, Sakari, nun Mikiloti. <verse eid="1CH 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 9:38" />Mikiloti naxa Simeyami sɔtɔ. E nu sabatixi e ngaxakerenyie fɛ ma Darisalamu. <verse eid="1CH 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 9:39" />Neri naxa Kisu sɔtɔ. Kisu naxa Sɔlu sɔtɔ. Sɔlu xa die nan ya: Yonatan, Malakisuwa, Abinadabo, nun Esibaali. <verse eid="1CH 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 9:40" />Yonatan naxa Meribaali sɔtɔ. Meribaali naxa Mike sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 9:41" />Mike xa die nan ya: Piton, Meleki, Tareya, nun Axasi. <verse eid="1CH 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 9:42" />Axasi naxa Yara sɔtɔ. Yara xa die nan ya: Alemeti, Asamafeti, nun Simiri. Simiri naxa Mosa sɔtɔ. Mosa naxa Bineya sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 9:43" />Bineya naxa Rɛfaya sɔtɔ. Rɛfaya naxa Eleyasa sɔtɔ. Eleyasa naxa Aseli sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 9:44" />Aseli xa di senni nan ya: Asirikama, Bokeru, Sumayila, Seyaraya, Abadiyasi, nun Xanan. Aseli xa die nan na ki.<verse eid="1CH 9:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CH 10" />
  <para style="s">Mangɛ Sɔlu xa faxɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1SA 31:1-13">Samuweli I 31:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 10:1" />Filisitakae naxa Isirayilakae gere. Isirayilakae naxa e gi, a gbegbe naxa faxa Gilibowa geya fari. <verse eid="1CH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 10:2" />Filisitakae naxa bira Sɔlu nun a xa die fɔxɔ ra, han e Yonatan, Abinadabo, nun Malakisuwa faxa. <verse eid="1CH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 10:3" />Gere naxa xɔrɔxɔ. Tanbɛ nde naxa Sɔlu sɔxɔ a ɲaaxi ra. <verse eid="1CH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 10:4" />A naxa a fala a xa geresose maxaninyi bɛ, «N faxa i xa santidɛgɛma ra, alako yi gaantaree naxa n nayaagi.» Kɔnɔ na xɛmɛ mu suusa na rabade. Na na a ra, Sɔlu naxa a yɛtɛ faxa a xa santidɛgɛma ra. <verse eid="1CH 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 10:5" />A xa geresose maxaninyi to na to, a fan naxa a yɛtɛ faxa. <verse eid="1CH 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 10:6" />Sɔlu nun a xa di saxanyi faxa na ki nɛ. A xa denbaya birin naxa laaxira tɛmui keren. <verse eid="1CH 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 10:7" />Isirayilakae, naxee nu sabatixi geya lanbanyi, e to a kolon a sɔɔrie na e gife, Sɔlu nun a xa die bara faxa, e fan naxa e gi. Filisitakae e xa taae birin sɔtɔ na ki nɛ.<verse eid="1CH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 10:8" />Na kuye iba, Filisitakae naxa gbilen gere yire, e xa sɔɔri faxaxie harige tongo. E naxa Sɔlu nun a xa die to Gilibowa geya fari. <verse eid="1CH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 10:9" />E to gɛ e xa harige tongode, e naxa Sɔlu xunyi nun a xa geresosee xanin sɔɔrie yire. E naxa na xibaarui masen Filisitakae birin bɛ, a nun e xa kuyee bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 10:10" />E naxa Sɔlu xa geresosee lu e xa ala xa banxi kui, e a xunyi gbaku e xa ala Dagɔn xa banxi kui. <verse eid="1CH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 10:11" />Yabɛsikae, naxee na Galadi, e to a mɛ Filisitakae naxan nabaxi Sɔlu ra, <verse eid="1CH 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 10:12" />e naxa siga e sa Sɔlu nun a xa die furee tongo, e fa e ragata Yabɛsi terebinti wuri bun ma Galadi. Yabɛsikae naxa sunyi suxu xi solofere. <verse eid="1CH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 10:13" />Sɔlu faxa a xa yanfanteya nan ma fe ra a naxan niya Alatala ra. A mu Alatala xa wɔyɛnyi suxu, a naxa marasi fen mixie ra naxee wɔyɛnma mixi faxaxie ra. <verse eid="1CH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 10:14" />A mu marasi fen Alatala ra, na na a ra Alatala naxa a faxa, a Sɔlu xa mangɛya fi Yisayi xa di Dawuda ma.<verse eid="1CH 10:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CH 11" />
  <para style="s">Dawuda findife Isirayila mangɛ ra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:1-10">Samuweli II 5:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 11:1" />Isirayilakae birin naxa a masen Dawuda bɛ Xebiron, «Won wuli keren, fasɛ keren. <verse eid="1CH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 11:2" />Hali Mangɛ Sɔlu xa waxati i tan nan nu Isirayila raɲɛrɛma. I Marigi Alatala naxa a masen i bɛ, ‹I xa n ma ɲama Isirayila raɲɛrɛ, i xa findi e xa yarerati ra.›» <verse eid="1CH 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 11:3" />Isirayila forie birin naxa siga a fɔxɔ ra Xebiron. Dawuda naxa saatɛ xiri e tagi Alatala ya i. E naxa ture sa a xunyi ma Isirayila mangɛ ki ma, alɔ Alatala nu bara a masen Annabi Samuweli bɛ ki naxɛ.<verse eid="1CH 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 11:4" />Mangɛ Dawuda nun Isirayilakae naxa siga Darisalamu, naxan man nu xili Yebusu, barima Yebusu bɔnsɔɛ nu sabatixi naa. <verse eid="1CH 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 11:5" />E naxa a fala Dawuda bɛ, «I mu soma be feo.» Kɔnɔ Dawuda naxa nɔ Siyon yire makantaxi masɔtɔde. Na kui e mɛnni xili fala Dawuda xa taa. <verse eid="1CH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 11:6" />Dawuda nu bara a fala, «Naxan singe na Yebusu gere, n na kanyi findima nɛ mangɛ ra.» Seruya xa di Yowaba singe nan gere so, a fa findi sɔɔrie xa mangɛ ra. <verse eid="1CH 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 11:7" />Dawuda naxa sabati na yire makantaxi kui, na na a ra naa xili naxa fala Dawuda xa taa. <verse eid="1CH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 11:8" />Dawuda naxa mɛnni nun a rabilinyi yailan. Yowaba fan naxa wali gbɛtɛ raba Darisalamu alako naa xa fan. <verse eid="1CH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 11:9" />Dawuda sɛnbɛ nu luma gbo ra, barima a nun Mangɛ Alatala nan nu a ra.<verse eid="1CH 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 11:10" />Dawuda xa sɔɔri xunyi, naxee bara a mali Isirayila mangɛya sɔtɔde, alɔ Alatala nu bara a masen ki naxɛ, <verse eid="1CH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 11:11" />na sɔɔri gbangbalanyie xilie nan ya: Xakimoni xa di Yasobeyami, naxan findi e xunyi ra. A nu bara mixi kɛmɛ saxan faxa tanbɛ ra gere keren kui. <verse eid="1CH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 11:12" />A firin nde findi Dodayi xa di Eleyasari nan na, Axowaka. A nu na Dawuda xa sɛnbɛma saxanyie ya ma. <verse eid="1CH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 11:13" />A nu bara Dawuda mali Filisitakae gerede Pasi Damimi. A xa sɔɔrie naxa e gi Filisitakae ma, mɛngi xɛ nu dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="1CH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 11:14" />Kɔnɔ Eleyasari naxa lu naa han a Filisitakae bɔnbɔ Alatala xa mali ra.<verse eid="1CH 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 11:15" />Yarerati saxan, Dawuda xa yarerati tongo saxanyie ya ma, naxa siga Dawuda yire Adulama fɔnmɛ ra. Filisitakae nu tixi Refa gulunba kui. <verse eid="1CH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 11:16" />Na waxati Dawuda nu sabatixi yire makantaxi, Filisitakae nu sabatixi Bɛtɛlɛɛmu mabiri. <verse eid="1CH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 11:17" />Dawuda naxa a sago nde fala, «A xɔli n ma n xa Bɛtɛlɛɛmu kɔlɔnyi ye min.» <verse eid="1CH 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 11:18" />Na sɔɔri yarerati saxanyie naxa Filisitakae xa naaninyi igiri, e sa ye ba kɔlɔnyi ra naxan na Bɛtɛlɛɛmu naadɛ ra. E to fa na ye ra Dawuda bɛ, a naxa tondi a minde. A naxa a ifili bɔxi ma sɛrɛxɛ ra Alatala bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 11:19" />A naxa a fala, «Ala xa n natanga na ma. N mu nɔma yi ye minde, n ma xɛmɛe naxan sɔtɔxi n bɛ e nii sare ra. Na luma alɔ e nii tide mu gbo n bɛ.» Na kui a naxa tondi na ye minde a xa sɛnbɛma saxanyie naxan sɔtɔ a bɛ.<verse eid="1CH 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 11:20" />Yowaba ngaxakerenyi Abisayi nan nu findixi na sɛnbɛma saxanyie xunyi ra. A nu bara xɛmɛ kɛmɛ saxan faxa a xa tanbɛ ra. A naxa xili xungbe sɔtɔ na xɛmɛ saxanyie ya ma. <verse eid="1CH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 11:21" />E naxa a binya, e a findi e xa mangɛ ra, kɔnɔ a mu lu e ya ma.<verse eid="1CH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 11:22" />Yehoyada xa di Bɛnaya Kabaseelika nu findixi sɔɔri magaaxuxi nan na. A nu bara fe xungbe gbegbe raba, alɔ Ariyɛli Mowabaka firinyi faxafe. A man naxa yɛtɛ nde faxa kɔlɔnyi kui balabalanyi tɛmui. <verse eid="1CH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 11:23" />Lɔxɔɛ nde a naxa Misiraka gbangbalanyi nde faxa, naxan xa maiteya kanke ya firin lima. Tanbɛ belebele nu na na Misiraka yi ra, naxan gbo alɔ dugi sɔxɔ wuri. Bɛnaya naxa na ba a yi ra, a a faxa a yɛtɛ xa tanbɛ ra. <verse eid="1CH 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 11:24" />Yehoyada xa di Bɛnaya xa fe xungbe nan na ki. A xili gbo na sɛnbɛma saxanyi ya ma. <verse eid="1CH 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 11:25" />A naxa binyɛ sɔtɔ dangi na xɛmɛ tongo saxan na, kɔnɔ a sɛnbɛ mu nu gbo na sɛnbɛma saxanyie bɛ. Dawuda xa gundo sɔɔri nan nu a ra.<verse eid="1CH 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 11:26" />Sɛnbɛma gbɛtɛe nan ya: Yowaba xunya Asahɛli, Dodo xa di Elexanan Bɛtɛlɛɛmuka, <verse eid="1CH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 11:27" />Samoti Harorika, Xɛlɛsi Pelonka, <verse eid="1CH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 11:28" />Ikesi xa di Ira Tekowaka, Abiyeseri Anatɔtika, <verse eid="1CH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 11:29" />Sibekayi Xusaka, Ilayi Axowaka, <verse eid="1CH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 11:30" />Maharayi Netofaka, Baanna xa di Xeleda Netofaka, <verse eid="1CH 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 11:31" />Ribayi xa di Itayi, naxan keli Gibiya Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ xa bɔxi ma, Bɛnaya Piratonka, <verse eid="1CH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 11:32" />Xurayi naxan keli Gaasi gulunba yire, Abiyɛli Arabaka, <verse eid="1CH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 11:33" />Asamafeti Baxurimika, Eliyaba Saalabonka, <verse eid="1CH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 11:34" />Hasemi xa die Gisonkae, Saage xa di Yonatan Hararaka, <verse eid="1CH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 11:35" />Sakara xa di Axiyama Hararaka, Uru xa di Elifala, <verse eid="1CH 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 11:36" />Xeferi Mekeraka, Ahiya Pelonka, <verse eid="1CH 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 11:37" />Xesero Karemeleka, Esibayi xa di Naarayi, <verse eid="1CH 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 11:38" />Natan ngaxakerenyi Yoweli, Hagari xa di Mibixari, <verse eid="1CH 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 11:39" />Sɛlɛki Amonika, Naxarayi Berotika, Seruya xa di Yowaba xa geresose xaninma, <verse eid="1CH 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 11:40" />Ira nun Garebe Yatirikae, <verse eid="1CH 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 11:41" />Uriya Xitika, Axalayi xa di Sabadi, <verse eid="1CH 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 11:42" />Siisa xa di Adina Rubenkae xa mangɛ nun a xa mixi tongo saxan, <verse eid="1CH 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 11:43" />Maaka xa di Xanan, Yosafati Mitinika, <verse eid="1CH 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 11:44" />Usiya Asatarotika, Xotama xa die Saama nun Yeyiyeli Arowerikae, <verse eid="1CH 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 11:45" />Simiri xa die Yediyayeli, Yoxa xunya Tisika, <verse eid="1CH 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 11:46" />Eliyeli Maxawika, Eliyeli xa die Yeribayi nun Yosawiya, Itima Mowabaka, <verse eid="1CH 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 11:47" />Eliyeli, Obedo, nun Yaasiyɛli Mesobaka.<verse eid="1CH 11:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CH 12" />
  <para style="s">Sɔɔri gbɛtɛe birafe Dawuda fɔxɔ ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 12:1" />Sɔɔrie nan ya naxee siga Dawuda yire Sikilaga, alako e xa a mali gere sode. Na waxati Dawuda mu nu na Kisu xa di Sɔlu fɛ ma. <verse eid="1CH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 12:2" />Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ nan nu e ra, Sɔlu ngaxakerenyie. E nu fata tanbɛ nun gɛmɛe wolide e yirefanyi nun e kɔɔla bɛlɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="1CH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 12:3" />E xilie nan ya: Mangɛ Axiyeseri, Semaa xa die Yowasi Gibiyaka, Asamafeti xa die Yesiyeli nun Pɛlɛti, Beraka nun Yehu Anatɔtika, <verse eid="1CH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 12:4" />Yisemaya Gabayonka, naxan findi sɔɔri xungbe ra na sɔɔri tongo saxan ya ma, a fan findi e xa mangɛ nan na, <verse eid="1CH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 12:5" />Yeremi, Yaxasiyeli, Yoxanan, nun Yosabadi Gederaka, <verse eid="1CH 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 12:6" />Elusayi, Yerimoti, Beyalaya, Sɛmaraya, Sɛfataya Xarufuka, <verse eid="1CH 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 12:7" />Elekana Koraka, Yisiya Koraka, Asarɛli Koraka, Yoweseri Koraka, Yasobeyami Koraka, <verse eid="1CH 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 12:8" />nun Yeroxama Gedorika xa die Yowela nun Sebadaya.<verse eid="1CH 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 12:9" />Sɔɔri gbangbalanyi Gadika ndee naxa siga Dawuda yire wula i. Nee fata gere ra, geresose nu na e yi ra alɔ kanke makantase nun tanbɛ. E sɛnbɛ nu gbo alɔ yɛtɛe, e xulun alɔ xeli naxee e gima geyae fari. <verse eid="1CH 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 12:10" />E xilie nan ya: Eseri, e xunyi, Abadiyasi, a firin nde, Eliyabi, a saxan nde, <verse eid="1CH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 12:11" />Misemanna, a naani nde, Yeremi, a suuli nde, <verse eid="1CH 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 12:12" />Atayi, a senni nde, Eliyeli, a solofere nde, <verse eid="1CH 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 12:13" />Yoxanan, a solomasaxan nde, Elesabada, a solomanaani nde, <verse eid="1CH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 12:14" />Yeremi, a fu nde, a nun Makabanayi, a fu nun keren nde. <verse eid="1CH 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 12:15" />Gadikae nan yi ki naxee findi sɔɔri xungbee ra. Naxan xurun e ya ma, a sɛnbɛ gbo mixi kɛmɛ bɛ. Naxan xungbo e ya ma, a sɛnbɛ gbo mixi wulu bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 12:16" />Nee naxa Yurudɛn xure giri a rafexi tɛmui naxɛ, kike singe, e fa geya lanbanyi mixie keri sogetede nun sogegorode mabiri.<verse eid="1CH 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 12:17" />Bunyaminka nun Yudayaka ndee naxa siga Dawuda xa yire makantaxi. <verse eid="1CH 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 12:18" />Dawuda naxa e ralan, a a fala e bɛ, «Xa wo faxi bɔɲɛsa nan kui alako wo xa n mali, won bɔɲɛe findima keren nan na. Kɔnɔ xa a sa a li wo faxi n yanfade n yaxuie nan bɛ, n tan naxan mu fe ɲaaxi yo rabaxi, won benbae Marigi Ala kiiti sama nɛ.» <verse eid="1CH 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 12:19" />Na tɛmui Alatala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi naxa goro Amasayi ma, naxan findi sɔɔri tongo saxan xunyi ra. A naxa a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:19">Ala xa Yisayi xa di Dawuda mali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:19">Ala xa bɔɲɛsa fi a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:19">Ala xa bɔɲɛsa fi Dawuda malima ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:19">barima Ala nan Dawuda malixi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 12:19">Na kui Dawuda naxa e rasɛnɛ, e xa lu a xa sɔɔri mangɛe ya ma.<verse eid="1CH 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 12:20" />Manasi sɔɔri ndee nu bara e sa Dawuda dɛ ra a nu wama kafufe Filisitakae ma tɛmui naxɛ Sɔlu gerede. E nun Dawuda mu nɔ Filisitakae malide barima Filisita mangɛ ndee nu bara gaaxu, e fa a fala, «Dawuda fama nɛ won yanfade, a kafu a marigi Sɔlu ma, e won gere.» <verse eid="1CH 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 12:21" />E to na fala, Dawuda naxa gbilen Sikilaga. Manasika naxee nu biraxi a fɔxɔ ra, e xilie nan ya: Adena, Yosabadi, Yediyayeli, Mikayeli, Yosabadi, Elihu, nun Siletayi. Sɔɔri wulu keren mangɛ nan nu na e birin na. <verse eid="1CH 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 12:22" />E nu Dawuda malima a xa sɔɔrie raɲɛrɛde, barima e birin fata sɔɔriɲa rabade. Singe, e nu Isirayila sɔɔrie nan naɲɛrɛma. <verse eid="1CH 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 12:23" />Lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ Dawuda malimae xun nu masama han a xa sɔɔri gali naxa lu alɔ Ala gbe.<verse eid="1CH 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 12:24" />Sɔɔri xasabi nan ya naxee fa Xebiron Dawuda yire, alako e xa Dawuda mali, Sɔlu xa mangɛya xa radangi a ma alɔ Alatala nu bara a masen ki naxɛ: <verse eid="1CH 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 12:25" />Yudayakae, sɔɔri wulu senni kɛmɛ solomasaxan. Geresose nu na e birin yi ra. <verse eid="1CH 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 12:26" />Simeyɔnkae, sɔɔri gbangbalanyie wulu solofere sɔɔri kɛmɛ. <verse eid="1CH 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 12:27" />Lewikae, sɔɔri wulu naani kɛmɛ senni. <verse eid="1CH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 12:28" />Yehoyada, naxan findi yarerati ra Haruna ɲɔxɔɛ ra, a nun a xa sɔɔri wulu saxan kɛmɛ solofere. <verse eid="1CH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 12:29" />Sadɔki, sɛgɛtala sɔɔri gbangbalanyi, nun a xabilɛ kuntigie, mixi mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin. <verse eid="1CH 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 12:30" />Bunyaminkae, Sɔlu bɔnsɔɛ, sɔɔri wulu saxan. E mu nu gbo barima a gbegbe nu na Sɔlu nan ma sɛɛti. <verse eid="1CH 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 12:31" />Efiramikae, sɔɔri wulu mɔxɔɲɛn kɛmɛ solomasaxan. E birin sɔɔri gbangbalanyi naxee benbae xili nu gbo. <verse eid="1CH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 12:32" />Manasikae, sɔɔri wulu fu nun solomasaxan. E tan nan nu sugandixi mangɛya radangife ra Dawuda ma. <verse eid="1CH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 12:33" />Isakarikae, kuntigi kɛmɛ firin nun e xa mixi naxee nu na e xa yaamari bun ma. E fan nu bara a kolon Isirayila lan a xa naxan naba na waxati. <verse eid="1CH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 12:34" />Sabulonkae, sɔɔri wulu tongo suuli. E rɛdixi gere xili ma, geresose nu na e yi ra. <verse eid="1CH 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 12:35" />Nafatalikae, sɔɔri xunyi wulu keren, a nun sɔɔri wulu tongo saxan nun solofere. Wure lefa nun tanbɛ nu na e birin yi ra. <verse eid="1CH 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 12:36" />Danakae, sɔɔri wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun solomasaxan kɛmɛ senni. Geresose na e birin yi ra. <verse eid="1CH 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 12:37" />Aserikae, sɔɔri wulu tongo naani. E birin rɛdixi. <verse eid="1CH 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 12:38" />Sɔɔri naxee keli Yurudɛn naakiri ma sogetede biri, nee findi Rubenkae, Gadikae, nun Manasikae nan na, e lan mixi wulu kɛmɛ mɔxɔɲɛn nan ma. Geresosee na e birin yi ra.<verse eid="1CH 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 12:39" />Yi sɔɔrie fa nɛ Xebiron alako e xa Dawuda dɔxɔ mangɛ ra Isirayila xun na. Na ɲanige nan nu na e bɛ. Isirayilakae birin nu bara na natɛ tongo. <verse eid="1CH 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 12:40" />E naxa lu mɛnni Dawuda yire xi saxan e e dɛgema, e e minma. E ngaxakerenyie nan nu na donse rafalama e bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 12:41" />E dɔxɔbooree fan naxa fa donse ra kelife ra Isakari bɔxi, Sabulon bɔxi, nun Nafatali bɔxi ma. E naxa fa na ra sofalee, ɲɔxɔmɛe, soee, nun ningee fari. E naxa fa kote mɔɔli birin na alɔ donse, farin, xɔrɛ xaraxi, wɛni bogi xaraxi, wɛni, ture, xuruse lanma nun a xungbe. E naxa fa a gbegbe ra barima Isirayilaka birin nu sɛɛwaxi.<verse eid="1CH 12:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CH 13" />
  <para style="s">Dawuda saatɛ kankira xaninfe Darisalamu.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 6:1-11">Samuweli II 6:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 13:1" />Dawuda naxa sɔɔri wulu xunyie, sɔɔri kɛmɛ xunyie, nun kuntigi birin xili, e xa malan. <verse eid="1CH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 13:2" />Dawuda naxa a fala Isirayila ɲama birin bɛ, «Xa a findixi fe fanyi nan na, xa a kelixi won Marigi Alatala nan ma, won xa xɛɛrae xɛɛ won ngaxakerenyie ma, naxee na Isirayila bɔxie ma. Won xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe nun Lewikae fan xili, naxee na Isirayila taae kui, alako won birin xa lu yire keren. <verse eid="1CH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 13:3" />Won xa won Marigi xa saatɛ kankira ragbilen won yire, barima Sɔlu xa mangɛya waxati, won mu siga a fɔxɔ ra.» <verse eid="1CH 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 13:4" />Ɲama birin naxa tin na fe fanyi ra.<verse eid="1CH 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 13:5" />Dawuda naxa Isirayila birin malan, keli Sixori xure ma Misira bɔxi, sa dɔxɔ Xamata ra, alako e xa Ala xa saatɛ kankira tongo Kiriyati Yeyarimi. <verse eid="1CH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 13:6" />Dawuda nun Isirayila birin naxa te Baala Yudaya bɔxi ma, dɛnnaxɛ xili Kiriyati Yeyarimi. E nu wama Ala xa saatɛ kankira tongofe. Alatala xa kibanyi nu na malekɛ sawurɛ firin tagi na kankira fari, Alatala maxandima dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="1CH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 13:7" />E naxa Ala xa saatɛ kankira tongo Abinadabo xɔnyi, e a dɔxɔ kote xanin se nɛɛnɛ kui. Usa nun Axiyo naxa a ragi. <verse eid="1CH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 13:8" />Dawuda nun Isirayilakae naxa sɛɛwa ki fanyi Ala ya xɔri. E naxa bɛɛti ba kɔrae, maxasee, nun sarae xui ra.<verse eid="1CH 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 13:9" />E to lɔnyi li e dɛnnaxɛ ma Kidon, ninge naxee nu kote xanin se mabɛndunma, naxa salaxun e wa birafe. Usa naxa saatɛ kankira suxu a bɛlɛxɛ ra alako a naxa bira. <verse eid="1CH 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 13:10" />Alatala naxa xɔnɔ Usa ma, a a faxa keren na, barima a mu nu lan a xa a bɛlɛxɛ din saatɛ kankira ra. Usa faxa na ki nɛ Ala ya xɔri.<verse eid="1CH 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 13:11" />Dawuda naxa xɔnɔ Usa faxafe ma. Mɛnni xili naxa sa «Usa gbaloe.» Han ya na xili saxi naa xun. <verse eid="1CH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 13:12" />Dawuda naxa gaaxu Ala ya ra na lɔxɔɛ. A naxa a yɛtɛ maxɔrin, «N Ala xa saatɛ kankira rasoma n xɔnyi di?» <verse eid="1CH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 13:13" />Na lɔxɔɛ Dawuda mu saatɛ kankira xanin a xɔnyi Darisalamu. A naxa a raso Obedo Edon xa banxi kui, naxan na Gati. <verse eid="1CH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 13:14" />Ala xa saatɛ kankira naxa lu Obedo Edon xa denbaya yire kike saxan. Alatala naxa barakɛ sa e ma na xa fe ra.<verse eid="1CH 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CH 14" />
  <para style="s">Dawuda xa denbaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:11-16">Samuweli II 5:11-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 14:1" />Tire mangɛ Xirami naxa mixie xɛɛ Dawuda xɔn ma alako e xa banxi belebele ti a tan Dawuda bɛ. E naxa sɛdiri wuri xanin e xun ma, a nun walikɛ naxee a rawalima. <verse eid="1CH 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 14:2" />Dawuda naxa a kolon a Alatala yati nan a findixi Isirayila mangɛ ra. A a kolon Ala luma a xa mangɛya ite ra a xa ɲama xa fe ra. <verse eid="1CH 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 14:3" />Dawuda naxa ginɛ gbɛtɛe dɔxɔ Darisalamu. E naxa di ginɛe nun di xɛmɛe bari a bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 14:4" />A xa di naxee barixi Darisalamu, e xilie nan ya: Samuwa, Sobabo, Natan, Sulemani, <verse eid="1CH 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 14:5" />Yibixari, Elisuwa, Elipeleti, <verse eid="1CH 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 14:6" />Noga, Nefegi, Yafiya, <verse eid="1CH 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 14:7" />Elisama, Beeliyada, nun Elifeleti.<verse eid="1CH 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filisitakae Dawuda gerefe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:17-25">Samuweli II 5:17-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 14:8" />Filisitakae to a mɛ Dawuda bara findi Isirayila mangɛ ra, e naxa siga a gerede. Dawuda fan naxa mini e ya ra. <verse eid="1CH 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 14:9" />Filisitakae naxa gere ti Isirayilakae bɛ naxee nu na Refa gulunba. <verse eid="1CH 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 14:10" />Dawuda naxa Ala maxɔrin, «N xa siga Filisitakae gerede? I e sama n sagoe?» Alatala naxa a masen a bɛ, «Siga, n fama nɛ e sade i sagoe.»<verse eid="1CH 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 14:11" />Dawuda nun a xa sɔɔrie naxa te Bali Perasimi, e fa Filisitakae bɔnbɔ. Na kui Dawuda naxa a fala, «Ala bara n yaxuie kana, alɔ ye gbegbe bogoni bɔɔma a ra ki naxɛ.» Na fe nan a toxi, Bali Perasimi xili falaxi yi yire xun. <verse eid="1CH 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 14:12" />Filisitakae nu bara e xa kuyee lu gere yire. Dawuda naxa yaamari fi e xa gan.<verse eid="1CH 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 14:13" />Filisitakae man naxa gere ti Isirayilakae bɛ naxee nu na Refa gulunba. <verse eid="1CH 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 14:14" />Dawuda man naxa Ala maxɔrin xa a lanma a xa e gere. Ala naxa a yaabi, «I naxa bira e fɔxɔ ra de. I xa e mabilin han wondi yire. I xa mamɛ ti mɛnni <verse eid="1CH 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 14:15" />han i xa xui nde mɛ wuri bilie kɔn na. Na tɛmui i fa mini wondi kui e gerede. N tan nan minima i ya ra, nee bɔnbɔ i bɛ.» <verse eid="1CH 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 14:16" />Dawuda naxa a raba alɔ Ala a masenxi a bɛ ki naxɛ. E naxa Filisitakae bɔnbɔ kelife Gabayon, sa dɔxɔ Geseri ra. <verse eid="1CH 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 14:17" />Na kui Dawuda xili naxa xungbo yire birin. Alatala naxa a niya si birin xa gaaxu Dawuda ya ra.<verse eid="1CH 14:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CH 15" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa saatɛ kankira sigafe Darisalamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 15:1" />Dawuda naxa banxie ti Darisalamu taa kui, dɛnnaxɛ nu xili Dawuda xa taa. Mɛnni a naxa kiri banxi ti Ala xa saatɛ kankira luma dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="1CH 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 15:2" />Dawuda naxa yaamari fi a mixi yo mu Ala xa saatɛ kankira maxaninma fo Lewikae, barima Alatala e tan nan sugandixi na ma. Na bara findi e xa wali ra tɛmui birin. <verse eid="1CH 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 15:3" />Dawuda naxa Isirayila birin xunlan Darisalamu Alatala xa saatɛ kankira rasofe ra banxi kui naxan nu yailanxi na xa fe ra.<verse eid="1CH 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 15:4" />Dawuda naxa Haruna xa die nun Lewikae malan:<verse eid="1CH 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 15:5" />Kehati xa die, mixi kɛmɛ mixi mɔxɔɲɛn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 15:5">E xunyi na Uriyeli nan na.<verse eid="1CH 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 15:6" />Merari xa die, mixi kɛmɛ firin mixi mɔxɔɲɛn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 15:6">E xunyi na Asaya nan na.<verse eid="1CH 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 15:7" />Gerison xa die, mixi kɛmɛ mixi tongo saxan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 15:7">E xunyi na Yoweli nan na.<verse eid="1CH 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 15:8" />Elisafan xa die, mixi kɛmɛ firin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 15:8">E xunyi na Semaya nan na.<verse eid="1CH 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 15:9" />Xebiron xa die, mixi tongo solomasaxan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 15:9">E xunyi na Eliyeli nan na.<verse eid="1CH 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 15:10" />Yusiyɛli xa die, mixi kɛmɛ mixi fu nun firin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 15:10">E xunyi na Aminadabo nan na.<verse eid="1CH 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 15:11" />Dawuda naxa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe Sadɔki nun Abiyatari, a nun Lewikae Uriyeli, Asaya, Yoweli, Semaya, Eliyeli nun Aminadabo xili. <verse eid="1CH 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 15:12" />A naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo tan nan na Lewi xa denbayae xunyie ra. Wo wo yɛtɛ rasɛniyɛn, wo tan nun wo xa mixie. Wo xa te wo Marigi Alatala xa saatɛ kankira ra. Wo xa a xanin yire n dɛnnaxɛ yailanxi a bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 15:13" />Tɛmui dangixi won Marigi Alatala nu bara xɔnɔ won ma, barima Lewikae nan nu lan e xa na xanin a sɛriyɛ ki ma.»<verse eid="1CH 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 15:14" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe nun Lewikae naxa e yɛtɛ rasɛniyɛn beenu e xa te Isirayila Marigi Alatala xa saatɛ kankira ra. <verse eid="1CH 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 15:15" />Lewikae naxa Alatala xa saatɛ kankira suxu wurie ma a xaninma naxee ra, e e sa e tunkie fari alɔ Alatala Annabi Munsa yamari ki naxɛ.<verse eid="1CH 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 15:16" />Dawuda naxa a fala Lewikae xunyie bɛ e xa bɛɛtiba ndee sugandi e xa mixie ya ma naxee bɛɛti bama kɔrae nun maxasee xui ra ɲɛlɛxinyi kui. <verse eid="1CH 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 15:17" />Lewikae naxa Yoweli xa di Heman sugandi, a nun Berekiya xa di Asafi, nun Kusaya xa di Etani, naxan nu na Merari xa die ya ma. <verse eid="1CH 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 15:18" />Lewikae gbɛtɛe nan nu na naadɛ kantɛe ra: Sakari, Ben, Yasiyeli, Semiramoti, Yɛxiyɛli, Unni, Eliyabi, Bɛnaya, Maaseya, Matitiya, Elifelehu, Mikineyahu, Obedo Edon, nun Yeyiyeli. <verse eid="1CH 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 15:19" />Lewika gbɛtɛe nan nu na bɛɛtibae ra: Heman, Asafi, nun Etani. E nu maxasee raberema ɲɛlɛxinyi kui. <verse eid="1CH 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 15:20" />Sakari, Asiyɛli, Semiramoti, Yɛxiyɛli, Unni, Eliyabi, Maaseya, nun Bɛnaya nu kɔrae raberema. <verse eid="1CH 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 15:21" />Matitiya, Elifelehu, Mikineyahu, Obedo Edon, Yeyiyeli, nun Asasiya nu kɔrae luuti solomasaxan daaxi raberema. <verse eid="1CH 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 15:22" />Lewika Kenaniya naxa findi xunyi ra naxan Ala xa saatɛ kankira xaninma. A nu na wali kolon. <verse eid="1CH 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 15:23" />Berekiya nun Elekana nu a malima na wali kui. <verse eid="1CH 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 15:24" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe Sɛbanaya, Yosafati, Netaneeli, Amasayi, Sakari, Bɛnaya, nun Eliyeseri nan nu sarae fema Ala xa saatɛ kankira ya ra. Obedo Edon nun Yexiya nan nu saatɛ kankira xaninyie ra.<verse eid="1CH 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 15:25" />Dawuda, Isirayila forie, nun sɔɔri wulu xunyie naxa ti kira xɔn alako e xa sa Alatala xa saatɛ kankira mati ɲɛlɛxinyi kui kelife ra Obedo Edon xɔnyi. <verse eid="1CH 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 15:26" />Ala naxa Lewikae mali a xa saatɛ kankira xaninde. Na kui e nu bara tuura solofere nun yɛxɛɛ kontonyi solofere ba sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="1CH 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 15:27" />Dawuda, Lewika naxee saatɛ kankira xaninma, bɛɛtibae, nun Kenaniya, bɛɛtibae xa mangɛ, e birin nu maxirixi donma tofanyie kui. Dawuda naxa sɛrɛxɛdubɛ donma fan nagoro a ma. <verse eid="1CH 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 15:28" />Isirayilakae birin naxa te Alatala xa saatɛ kankira ra ɲɛlɛxinyi kui. Ndee naxa ferie nun sarae fe, ndee naxa maxasee nun kɔrae rabere.<verse eid="1CH 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 15:29" />Sɔlu xa di ginɛ Mikala naxa Isirayilakae to Alatala xa saatɛ kankira raso ra Dawuda xa taa kui. A to mangɛ Dawuda to fare boron na ɲɛlɛxinyi kui, a naxa mangɛ Dawuda raɲaaxu.<verse eid="1CH 15:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CH 16" />
  <para style="s">Dawuda Ala tantufe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 16:1" />E to so Darisalamu, e naxa Ala xa saatɛ kankira dɔxɔ hɔrɔmɔlingira kui, Dawuda naxan yailanxi a lude ra. E naxa sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi nun xanunteya sɛrɛxɛ ba. <verse eid="1CH 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 16:2" />Dawuda to gɛ na sɛrɛxɛe bade, a naxa duba Isirayila ɲama bɛ Alatala xili ra. <verse eid="1CH 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 16:3" />Na xanbi a naxa taami, sube, nun donse ɲɔxunmɛ so Isirayilakae birin yi ra.<verse eid="1CH 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 16:4" />A Lewika naxee sugandi dubafe ra ɲama bɛ, e Isirayila Marigi Alatala matɔxɔ, e a tantu a xa saatɛ kankira ya ra. Nee xilie nan ya: <verse eid="1CH 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 16:5" />Asafi, naxan findi e xunyi ra, Sakari, naxan na na xanbi ra, Yeyiyeli, Semiramoti, Yɛxiyɛli, Matitiya, Eliyabi, Bɛnaya, Obedo Edon, nun Yeyiyeli. Kɔrae nu na e yi ra, maxasee nu na Asafi yi ra. <verse eid="1CH 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 16:6" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ Bɛnaya nun Yaxasiyeli nu sarae fema Ala xa saatɛ kankira ya ra.<verse eid="1CH 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 16:7" />Na lɔxɔɛ Dawuda naxa yi bɛɛti so Asafi nun a xa mixie yi ra alako e xa Alatala tantu.<verse eid="1CH 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 16:8" />Wo Alatala matɔxɔ, wo a maxandi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:8">Wo a masen sie bɛ a fe xungbe naxee rabaxi.<verse eid="1CH 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 16:9" />Wo bɛɛti ba a bɛ, wo a tantu binyɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:9">Wo wo maɲɔxun a xa fe fanyi birin ma.<verse eid="1CH 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 16:10" />Wo a xili sɛniyɛnxi matɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:10">Wo tan naxee na Alatala fenfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:10">sɛɛwɛ xa lu wo bɔɲɛe kui.<verse eid="1CH 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 16:11" />Wo xa bira Alatala nun a sɛnbɛ fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:11">Wo wo ya rafindi a ma.<verse eid="1CH 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 16:12" />Wo wo ratu a xa kaabanakoe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:12">a xa fe fanyie ma a naxee rabaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:12">a nun a xa marasi.<verse eid="1CH 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 16:13" />Wo tan Isirayila bara findi a xa konyie ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:13">Yaxuba xa die, Alatala bara wo sugandi.<verse eid="1CH 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 16:14" />Alatala nan na won Marigi Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:14">A tan nan kiiti sama bɔxi birin ma.<verse eid="1CH 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 16:15" />Wo wo ratu a xa saatɛ ma tɛmui birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:15">a xa wɔyɛnyi ma abadan.<verse eid="1CH 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 16:16" />A na saatɛ naxan tongo Iburahima bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:16">a a kali Isiyaga bɛ.<verse eid="1CH 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 16:17" />A na nan xirixi e nun Yaxuba tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:17">a findi saatɛ ra Isirayila bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:17">naxan mu kanama abadan.<verse eid="1CH 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 16:18" />Na saatɛ nan ya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:18">«N Kanaan bɔxi fima nɛ wo ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:18">a findi wo kɛ ra.»<verse eid="1CH 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 16:19" />Wo mu nu gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:19">xɔɲɛ nan nu wo ra na bɔxi kui.<verse eid="1CH 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 16:20" />Wo to siga ɲamanɛ gbɛtɛe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:20">wo naxa lu e xa mangɛya bun ma,<verse eid="1CH 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 16:21" />Ala mu tin mixi yo xa wo ɲaxankata.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:21">A naxa mangɛe rakɔrɔsi wo xa fe ra,<verse eid="1CH 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 16:22" />«Wo naxa wo bɛlɛxɛ din n ma mixi sugandixie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:22">wo naxa n ma namiɲɔnmɛe tɔɔrɔ.»<verse eid="1CH 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 16:23" />Duniɲa birin xa bɛɛti ba Alatala bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:23">Lɔxɔɛ birin wo xa a xa kisi xa fe masen.<verse eid="1CH 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 16:24" />Wo xa a xa fe fanyie tagi raba si gbɛtɛe bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:24">wo xa a xa kaabanakoe masen duniɲa birin bɛ.<verse eid="1CH 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 16:25" />Alatala sɛnbɛ gbo, a lanma won xa a matɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:25">A magaaxu alae birin bɛ.<verse eid="1CH 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 16:26" />Wule nan na si gbɛtɛe xa alae ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:26">kɔnɔ Alatala nan koore daaxi.<verse eid="1CH 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 16:27" />Nɔrɛ xungbe na a yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:27">sɛnbɛ nun sɛɛwɛ gbo a xɔnyi.<verse eid="1CH 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 16:28" />Si birin, wo xa Alatala matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:28">wo xa a sɛnbɛ kolon.<verse eid="1CH 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 16:29" />Wo xa a xili matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:29">wo xa sɛrɛxɛe ba a bɛ a xa hɔrɔmɔlingira kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:29">wo xa a batu sɛniyɛnyi kui.<verse eid="1CH 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 16:30" />Adama birin xa sɛrɛn a ya ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:30">Ala mu tinma duniɲa xun xa rakana.<verse eid="1CH 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 16:31" />Koore nun duniɲa xa sɛɛwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:31">birin xa a kolon Alatala nan mangɛ ra.<verse eid="1CH 16:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 16:32" />Baa nun yɛxɛɛe xa Ala sɛnbɛ masen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:32">bɔxi nun subee xa Ala xa fanyi masen.<verse eid="1CH 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 16:33" />Wondi wuri xa Alatala xili masen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:33">naxan fafe duniɲa makiitide.<verse eid="1CH 16:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 16:34" />Wo xa Alatala tantu barima a fan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:34">a xa xanunteya mu kanama abadan.<verse eid="1CH 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 16:35" />Wo xa a masen Ala bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:35">«Ala, muxu rakisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:35">muxu ratanga si gbɛtɛe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:35">alako muxu xa i xili matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:35">na xa findi fe fanyi ra muxu bɛ.<verse eid="1CH 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 16:36" />Tantui na Isirayila Marigi Alatala bɛ tɛmui birin.»</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CH 16:36" />
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:36">Ɲama naxa a ratin, «Tantui na Alatala bɛ.»<verse eid="1CH 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 16:37" />Dawuda naxa Asafi nun a xunyae yamari e xa mɛɛni Alatala xa saatɛ kankira ma tɛmui birin. <verse eid="1CH 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 16:38" />A naxa Yedutun xa di Obedo Edon, nun Xosa, a nun a xa mixi tongo senni nun solomasaxan yamari e xa hɔrɔmɔlingira naadɛ kanta. <verse eid="1CH 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 16:39" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ Sadɔki nun a xa mixie naxa lu Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira naxan nu na Gabayon geya fari. <verse eid="1CH 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 16:40" />A nu lan nɛ e xa sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ba gɛɛsɛgɛ nun nunmare tɛmui Alatala bɛ alɔ a sɛbɛxi Isirayilakae bɛ kitaabui kui ki naxɛ. <verse eid="1CH 16:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 16:41" />Heman, Yedutun, nun boore naxee nu sugandixi fan nu na alako e xa Alatala tantu, barima a xa fonisireya mu ɲɔnma abadan. <verse eid="1CH 16:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 16:42" />Heman nun Yedutun nu sarae fema, e nu maxasee raberema alako e xa bɛɛti ba Alatala bɛ. Yedutun xa die nan nu na naadɛ kantɛe ra. <verse eid="1CH 16:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 16:43" />Na dangi xanbi, ɲama birin naxa siga e xɔnyi. Dawuda fan naxa gbilen a xɔnyi, a xa duba a xa denbaya bɛ.<verse eid="1CH 16:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1CH 17" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa saatɛ Dawuda bɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 7:1-17">Samuweli II 7:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 17:1" />Dawuda to gɛ sabatide a xa banxi nɛɛnɛ kui, a naxa a fala Annabi Natan bɛ, «I bara a to, n na banxi tofanyi nan kui naxan yailanxi sɛdiri wuri ra, kɔnɔ Alatala xa saatɛ kankira tan na kiri banxi nan kui.» <verse eid="1CH 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 17:2" />Annabi Natan naxa Dawuda yaabi, «I xa i waxɔnfe raba, barima wo nun Ala na a ra.»<verse eid="1CH 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 17:3" />Na kɔɛ ra, Ala naxa a masen Annabi Natan bɛ, <verse eid="1CH 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 17:4" />«Sa a fala n ma konyi Dawuda bɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya, ‹I tan mu banxi tima n bɛ n luma dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="1CH 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 17:5" />Kabi n Isirayila ramini Misira bɔxi kui han to, n na kiri banxi nan kui. Banxi gbɛtɛ yo mu nu na n yi ra. <verse eid="1CH 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 17:6" />Muxu nun Isirayila xa ɲɛrɛ kui, n mu a fala n ma ɲama xa yarerati yo bɛ, n naxee sugandi e xa mɛɛni n ma ɲama ma, e xa banxi sɛdiri wuri daaxi ti n bɛ.› <verse eid="1CH 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 17:7" />Yakɔsi i xa a masen n ma konyi Dawuda bɛ, ‹Mangɛ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya: I nu na gɔɔrɛ nɛ xuruse kantade, n naxa i findi n ma ɲama Isirayila xa mangɛ ra. <verse eid="1CH 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 17:8" />I nu sigama dɛnnaxɛ birin won birin nan nu a ra, n naxa i yaxuie halaki i ya ra, n naxa i xili rate alɔ mixi binye naxee na bɔxi fari. <verse eid="1CH 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 17:9" />N bara yire nde sugandi n ma ɲama Isirayila bɛ e sabatima dɛnnaxɛ, alako e naxa gaaxu sɔnɔn, tinxintaree xa e lu naa. <verse eid="1CH 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 17:10" />N e malima nɛ alɔ n a raba ki naxɛ n to kiitisae dɔxɔ n ma ɲama Isirayila xun ma. N man na rabama i tan fan bɛ, i xa ti i yaxuie fari. N tan Alatala fama nɛ sɛnbɛ fide i ma a nun i xabilɛ birin. <verse eid="1CH 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 17:11" />I xa duniɲɛigiri na kamali tɛmui naxɛ, i naxa gbilen i benbae yire, n mɛɛnima nɛ i xa die ma. N keren sugandima nɛ, a xa findi mangɛ ra i ɲɔxɔɛ ra. <verse eid="1CH 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 17:12" />Na kanyi nan fama hɔrɔmɔbanxi tide n bɛ. N a rasabatima mangɛya kui, alako a xa bu abadan. <verse eid="1CH 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 17:13" />N findima a baba nan na, a tan fan findima n ma di nan na. N ma fonisireya mu bama a yi ra alɔ n a ba ki naxɛ mangɛ singe yi ra. <verse eid="1CH 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 17:14" />N a findima n ma ɲama xa mangɛ nan na, a xa mangɛya mu kanama abadan.›»<verse eid="1CH 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 17:15" />Annabi Natan naxa Ala xa masenyi ti Dawuda bɛ alɔ Ala a masenxi a bɛ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="1CH 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 17:16" />Na xanbi mangɛ Dawuda naxa siga, a sa a yɛtɛ dɛntɛgɛ Marigi Alatala bɛ, a a fala, «N Marigi Alatala, nde na n tan na a nun n ma denbaya ra naxan a niyama i xa yi natɛ mɔɔli tongo muxu bɛ? <verse eid="1CH 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 17:17" />N Marigi Ala, i naxan falaxi i xa konyi xa denbaya xa fe ra, fe xuri mu a ra de! N Marigi Alatala i bara hinnɛ n na alɔ mixi xungbe. <verse eid="1CH 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 17:18" />N tan Dawuda, n nɔma munse falade i bɛ yi xunnakeli xa fe ra i naxan fixi i xa konyi ma? I i xa konyi kolon. <verse eid="1CH 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 17:19" />Marigi Alatala, i bara yi natɛ tongo n bɛ i xa xanunteya xa fe ra alako duniɲa xa i sɛnbɛ kolon.»<verse eid="1CH 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 17:20" />«Alatala, i maniyɛ mu na, ala gbɛtɛ mu na ba i tan na. Muxu bara na kolon. <verse eid="1CH 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 17:21" />Si gbɛtɛ na duniɲa naxan luma alɔ Isirayila naxan Marigi a raminixi konyiya kui, a a findi a xa ɲama ra? I bara kaabanakoe raba, fe magaaxuxie. I bara sie keri i xa ɲama ya ra, i naxan naminixi Misira bɔxi ra, alako i xili xa kolon. <verse eid="1CH 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 17:22" />Marigi Alatala, i bara a ragiri Isirayila xa findi i xa ɲama ra, i fan bara findi e Marigi Ala ra. Na mu kanama abadan.»<verse eid="1CH 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 17:23" />«Marigi Alatala, i xa masenyi i xa konyi nun a xa denbaya xa fe ra, na xa kamali. I naxan fala, yandi i xa na ragiri. <verse eid="1CH 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 17:24" />I xa na ragiri alako i xili xa gbo tɛmui birin. Duniɲa xa a fala, ‹Mangɛ Alatala, Isirayila Marigi Ala nan a ra.› I xa konyi Dawuda, nun a xa denbaya, i xa mɛɛni e ma abadan. <verse eid="1CH 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 17:25" />N Marigi Ala, i bara i ɲanige masen i xa konyi bɛ a falafe ra i xa a xa denbaya xun nakeli. Na na a ra i xa konyi bara limaniya i maxandife ra. <verse eid="1CH 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 17:26" />Alatala, i tan nan na Ala ra. I bara yi masenyi fanyi ti i xa konyi bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 17:27" />I bara wa i xa konyi xa denbaya barakafe, alako a xa balo i ya i abadan. Alatala barakɛ sama naxan ma, na barakɛ mu bama a yi ra abadan.»<verse eid="1CH 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1CH 18" />
  <para style="s">Dawuda nɔla sɔtɔfe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 8:1-18">Samuweli II 8:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 18:1" />Na to dangi, Dawuda naxa Filisitakae bɔnbɔ, a e rayaagi. A naxa Gati nun a rabilinyie ba e yi ra. <verse eid="1CH 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 18:2" />A naxa Mowabakae fan bɔnbɔ, e fa lu a xa yaamari bun ma, e duuti ba. <verse eid="1CH 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 18:3" />Dawuda naxa Soba mangɛ Hadadeseri fan bɔnbɔ Xamata mabiri, barima a nu wama Efirati xure xa lu a xa yaamari bun ma. <verse eid="1CH 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 18:4" />Dawuda naxa sɔɔri ragise wulu keren, soe ragi wulu solofere, nun sɔɔri wulu mɔxɔɲɛn ba e yi ra. A naxa soe birin tore bolon fo soe kɛmɛ ɲɔndɔn a naxee ragata a yɛtɛ bɛ.<verse eid="1CH 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 18:5" />Siriyaka naxee na Damasi naxa fa Soba mangɛ Hadadeseri malide, kɔnɔ Dawuda naxa sɔɔri wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin bɔnbɔ e ra. <verse eid="1CH 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 18:6" />Dawuda naxa a xa sɔɔrie dɔxɔ Siriya bɔxi ma Damasi taa kui. Siriyakae naxa lu Dawuda xa yaamari bun, e duuti ba a bɛ. Dawuda siga dɛdɛ, Alatala nu xunnakeli fima nɛ a ma. <verse eid="1CH 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 18:7" />Dawuda naxa Hadadeseri xa sɔɔrie xa wure lefa xanin Darisalamu xɛɛma masoxi naxee ma. <verse eid="1CH 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 18:8" />A naxa Hadadeseri xa yɔxui gbegbe tongo Tibati nun Kunu. Sulemani naxa na yailan maxase xungbe ra, salide kɔntigibae, a nun sɛrɛxɛbade walisee ra naxee nu rawalima hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui.<verse eid="1CH 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 18:9" />Xamata mangɛ Tohu naxa a mɛ a Dawuda bara Soba mangɛ Hadadeseri xa sɔɔrie birin bɔnbɔ. <verse eid="1CH 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 18:10" />A naxa a xa di Hadorami xɛɛ mangɛ Dawuda xɔn, a xa a xɛɛbu a bɛ, a man xa a matɔxɔ a xa gere xa fe ra Hadadeseri mabiri ra. A man naxa xɛɛma, gbeti, nun yɔxui fi Dawuda ma, barima gere nu na Tohu nun Hadadeseri tagi. <verse eid="1CH 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 18:11" />Mangɛ Dawuda naxa na birin fi Alatala ma, a nun gbeti nun xɛɛma a naxan nasuxu sie birin yi ra alɔ Edon, Mowaba, Amoni, Filisita, nun Amalɛki.<verse eid="1CH 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 18:12" />Seruya xa di Abisayi naxa Edonka wulu fu nun solomasaxan bɔnbɔ gulunba kui Fɔxɔɛ yire. <verse eid="1CH 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 18:13" />A naxa sɔɔrie lu Edon alako naa birin xa lu Dawuda xa yaamari bun ma. Dawuda siga dɛdɛ, Alatala nu xunnakeli fima nɛ a ma.<verse eid="1CH 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 18:14" />Dawuda naxa a xa ɲama Isirayila yamari sɛriyɛ nun tinxinyi ra. <verse eid="1CH 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 18:15" />Seruya xa di Yowaba nan nu na sɔɔrie xa mangɛ ra. Axiludu xa di Yehosafati nan nu na mangɛ xa xui madangi ra. <verse eid="1CH 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 18:16" />Axituba xa di Sadɔki nun Abiyatari xa di Abimeleki nan nu na sɛrɛxɛdubɛe ra. Sawesa nan nu na mangɛ xa sɛbɛliti ra. <verse eid="1CH 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 18:17" />Yehoyada xa di Bɛnaya nan nu na Keretikae nun Peletakae xunyi ra. Mangɛ Dawuda xa die nan nu na a xanbi ra.<verse eid="1CH 18:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1CH 19" />
  <para style="s">Dawuda nun Amonikae xa gere</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 10:1-19">Samuweli II 10:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 19:1" />Na to dangi, naxan naba na nan yi ki. Amonikae xa mangɛ Naxasa naxa faxa, a xa di naxa ti a ɲɔxɔɛ ra. <verse eid="1CH 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 19:2" />Dawuda naxa a maɲɔxun, «N fe fanyi rabama nɛ Naxasa xa di Xanun bɛ, barima a baba fe fanyi raba nɛ n bɛ.» Dawuda naxa xɛɛrae xɛɛ Xanun xɔn e xa sa a nu tɔɔrɔ a nu sɛgɛ sa a baba ɲɔnfe ma. Dawuda xa xɛɛrae naxa so Amonikae xa bɔxi ma Xanun yire, e xa a nu tɔɔrɔ sa. <verse eid="1CH 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 19:3" />Kɔnɔ Amonikae xa kuntigie naxa a fala Xanun bɛ, «I ɲɔxɔ a ma Dawuda yee xɛɛxi i nu tɔɔrɔ sade i baba ɲɔnfe nan ma? E faxi nɛ e xa fa be kolon, e xa be ya iso, e xa yi bɔxi tegerenya raba. A xa xɛɛrae faxi be na nan ma.»<verse eid="1CH 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 19:4" />Na kui Xanun naxa Dawuda xa xɛɛrae suxu, a naxa e dɛ xabe maxaba, a naxa e xa donmae raxaba e xɔrɛ yailanyi, a fa e rabɛɲin. <verse eid="1CH 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 19:5" />Mixi nde to na fe dɛntɛgɛ Dawuda bɛ, a naxa mixie xɛɛ a xa xɛɛrae yire a falafe ra, «Wo lu Yeriko han wo dɛ xabee xa mini. Na tɛmui wo xa gbilen be.» Dawuda xa xɛɛrae xaxili nu bara ifu ki fanyi ra.<verse eid="1CH 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 19:6" />Xanun nun Amonikae to a kolon a e bara xɔnnanteya raso e nun Dawuda tagi, e naxa gbeti kilo wulu tongo saxan nun naani fi Siriyakae ma, naxee nu na Mesopotamiya, Maaka nun Soba, alako e xa fa sɔɔri ragisee nun soe ragie ra e bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 19:7" />Na kui Maaka mangɛ nun a xa ɲama naxa fa sɔɔri ragise wulu tongo saxan nun firin na, e fa malan Medeba. Amonikae fan naxa mini e xa taae kui, alako e xa Dawuda gere. <verse eid="1CH 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 19:8" />Dawuda fɛfɛ na kolon, a naxa sɔɔri mangɛ Yowaba nun a xa sɔɔri gbangbalanyi birin xɛɛ e yire. <verse eid="1CH 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 19:9" />Amonikae naxa mini, e ti gere ki ma taa sode dɛ ra. Mangɛ naxee fa e malide, e nu tixi e xati ma daaxa i.<verse eid="1CH 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 19:10" />Yowaba naxa a kolon gere na a ya ra, a man na a xanbi ra. A naxa Isirayila sɔɔri fanyie mayegeti, a e ti Siriyakae ya ra. <verse eid="1CH 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 19:11" />A naxa sɔɔri dɔnxɔɛe lu a xunya Abisayi xa yaamari bun ma, e xa ti Amonikae ya ra. <verse eid="1CH 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 19:12" />Yowaba naxa a fala a xunya bɛ, «Xa Siriyakae sɛnbɛ gbo n bɛ, i xa fa n malide. Xa Amonikae fan sɛnbɛ gbo i bɛ, n fan sigama i malide. <verse eid="1CH 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 19:13" />I xa limaniya, won xa won sɛnbɛ so won bɔnsɔɛ xa fe ra nun won Marigi Ala xa taae xa fe ra. Alatala xa a waxɔnfe raba.»<verse eid="1CH 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 19:14" />Yowaba nun a xa sɔɔrie naxa Siriyakae gere. Nee naxa e gi Yowaba ma. <verse eid="1CH 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 19:15" />Amonikae to a to, Siriyakae bara e gi, e fan naxa e gi Abisayi ma. Yowaba xunya naxa so taa kui, Yowaba naxa gbilen Darisalamu.<verse eid="1CH 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 19:16" />Siriyakae to a kolon Isirayila bara e bɔnbɔ, e naxa xɛɛrae xɛɛ Siriyakae ma naxee nu na xure naakiri ma. Hadadeseri xa sɔɔri mangɛ Sofaki nan nu na e xunyi ra. <verse eid="1CH 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 19:17" />Dawuda to na kolon, a naxa Isirayilakae birin malan, e naxa fa e Yurudɛn igiri, e siga Siriyakae gerede. Siriyakae man naxa e gi Isirayilakae ya ra. <verse eid="1CH 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 19:18" />Dawuda naxa sɔɔri nun e ragise dɔxɔ wulu solofere faxa, a nun sɔɔri wulu tongo naani gbɛtɛ. A naxa sɔɔri mangɛ Sofaki fan faxa. <verse eid="1CH 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 19:19" />Hadadeseri malimae to a kolon a Isirayilakae bara e bɔnbɔ, e naxa lanyi xiri e nun Dawuda tagi, e naxa lu a xa yaamari bun. Kabi na waxati, Siriyakae mu tinma Amonikae malide sɔnɔn.<verse eid="1CH 19:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1CH 20" />
  <para style="s">Dawuda Amonikae nun Filisitakae gerefe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 11:1">Samuweli II 11:1</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 12:26-31">12:26-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 20:1" />Na ɲɛ igbilenyi, gere tɛmui to a li, Yowaba nun a xa sɔɔri gbangbalanyie naxa siga Amonikae gerede. Yowaba naxa taa nde suxu naxan xili Raba, a fa mɛnni kana. Dawuda tan naxa lu Darisalamu. <verse eid="1CH 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 20:2" />Dawuda naxa mangɛ tɔnxuma xɛɛma daaxi ba Amonikae xa mangɛ xunyi ma, naxan xa binyɛ dangi kilo tongo saxan na. Gɛmɛ tofanyi diyaman daaxi fan nu na a ma. Na mangɛ tɔnxuma naxa dɔxɔ Dawuda xun ma, a fa se gbegbe xanin a xun ma a naxan sɔtɔ gere kui. <verse eid="1CH 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 20:3" />Ɲama naxan nu na naa, Dawuda naxa e xanin a xun ma, a e findi konyie ra naxee wuri, gɛmɛ, nun wure xabama. A Amonikae xa taa birin xa fe raba na ki nɛ. Na xanbi, Dawuda nun a xa sɔɔrie naxa gbilen Darisalamu.<verse eid="1CH 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 20:4" />Na to dangi, Isirayilakae nun Filisitakae naxa gere Geseri. Na gere kui, Sibekayi Xusaka naxa Sipayi faxa. Sipayi findi Refa bɔnsɔɛ nan na. Filisitakae naxa yaagi na fe ma.<verse eid="1CH 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 20:5" />Isirayilakae nun Filisitakae man naxa gere. Yi biyaasi Yayiri xa di Elexanan naxa Goliyati xunya Laxami Gatika faxa. A sɛnbɛ nu gbo, a xa tanbɛ xa xungboe nu luxi alɔ dugi sɔxɔ wuri.<verse eid="1CH 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 20:6" />Gere gbɛtɛ naxa mini Gati. Xɛmɛ kuye nde nu na, sole senni nan nu na a salonse birin ma, nee malanxi mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani. Na fan Rafa bɔnsɔɛ nan nu a ra. <verse eid="1CH 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 20:7" />A to Isirayila konbi, Dawuda xunya Simeya xa di Yonatan naxa a faxa. <verse eid="1CH 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 20:8" />Yi xɛmɛe birin fatanxi Rafa bɔnsɔɛ nan ma naxan nu sabatixi Gati. Dawuda nun a xa sɔɔrie naxa e birin sɔntɔ.<verse eid="1CH 20:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1CH 21" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila ɲama kɔntife</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 24:1-9">Samuweli II 24:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 21:1" />Sentanɛ to wa Isirayila ratantanfe, a naxa Dawuda bɔɲɛ rate a xa Isirayilakae kɔnti. <verse eid="1CH 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 21:2" />Dawuda naxa a fala Yowaba nun kuntigie bɛ, «Wo siga, wo xa sa Isirayilakae kɔnti, keli Beriseeba ma, sa dɔxɔ Dana ra. Wo xa na xasabi dɛntɛgɛ n bɛ.» <verse eid="1CH 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 21:3" />Yowaba naxa a yaabi, «Alatala xa Isirayila ɲama rawuya dɔxɔ kɛmɛ. Mangɛ, n marigi, i xa konyie xa mu nee birin na? I yi mɔɔli maxɔrinxi munfe ra? Munfe ra i wama Isirayila xa yi yunubi sɔtɔ?» <verse eid="1CH 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 21:4" />Kɔnɔ mangɛ xui mu matandima, na na a ra Yowaba naxa mini, a naxa Isirayila birin iɲɛrɛ, a fa gbilen Darisalamu. <verse eid="1CH 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 21:5" />A naxa ɲama xasabi fala Dawuda bɛ. Isirayilakae xa kɔnti nan ya: xɛmɛ santidɛgɛma kanyi miliyɔn keren, wulu kɛmɛ. Yudayakae xa kɔnti nan ya: xɛmɛ santidɛgɛma kanyi wulu kɛmɛ naani, tongo solofere. <verse eid="1CH 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 21:6" />Yowaba mu Lewi nun Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ kɔnti, barima mangɛ xa yaamari mu nu rafanxi a ma.<verse eid="1CH 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 21:7" />Yi yaamari naxa raɲaaxu Ala ma. A naxa Isirayila xa tantanyi seri ba. <verse eid="1CH 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 21:8" />Dawuda naxa a fala Ala bɛ, «N to yi rabaxi, n bara yunubi belebele raba. Yakɔsi n bara i mayandi i xa diɲɛ i xa konyi xa yunubi ma. Na bara findi n ma daxuɲa ra.» <verse eid="1CH 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 21:9" />Alatala naxa a masen Gadi bɛ, naxan findi namiɲɔnmɛ ra mangɛ bɛ Dawuda xa waxati, <verse eid="1CH 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 21:10" />«I xa a fala Dawuda bɛ, Alatala yi nan masenxi i bɛ, ‹N bara fe saxan masen i bɛ, i xa keren sugandi i wama n xa naxan naba i ra.›» <verse eid="1CH 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 21:11" />Gadi naxa siga Dawuda yire, a a fala a bɛ, «Alatala yi nan masenxi i bɛ, <verse eid="1CH 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 21:12" />‹I bara tin ɲaxankatɛ mundun na: kaamɛ xa sin bɔxi ɲɛ saxan, xa na mu i yaxuie xa nɔ wo ra e xa santidɛgɛma ra kike saxan, xa na mu Alatala xa a xa malekɛ xɛɛ a xa Isirayila ɲama halaki, a xa bɔxi birin kana a xa santidɛgɛma ra nun fure ɲaaxi ra xi saxan. Yakɔsi i xa a mato n lan n xa naxan fala n xɛɛma bɛ.›» <verse eid="1CH 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 21:13" />Dawuda naxa Gadi yaabi, «N bɔɲɛ bara maɲaaxu a xɔrɔxɔɛ ra. A lan n xa n sa Alatala bɛlɛxɛ i naxan xa kinikini gbo. Na fisa adamadie bɛlɛxɛe bɛ.» <verse eid="1CH 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 21:14" />Alatala naxa fure ɲaaxi radin Isirayila ma han xɛmɛ wulu tongo solofere naxa faxa Isirayila bɔxi ma. <verse eid="1CH 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 21:15" />Ala naxa malekɛ xɛɛ Darisalamu, a xa sa naa kana. A nu naa kanafe tɛmui naxɛ, Alatala naxa e xa tɔɔrɛ mato, a fa nimisa. A naxa a masen malekɛ bɛ naxan nu na naa kanafe, «Na lan. E lu naa sinden.» Alatala xa malekɛ nu tixi Oronan Yebusuka xa lonyi ma. <verse eid="1CH 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 21:16" />Dawuda to a ya rate, a naxa Alatala xa malekɛ to, a tixi koore ma, a xa santidɛgɛma baxi a tɛɛ i, a ya rafindixi Darisalamu ma. Dawuda nun forie naxa sunnun donma ragoro e ma, e e yatagi rafelen bɔxi. <verse eid="1CH 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 21:17" />Dawuda naxa a fala Ala bɛ, «N tan xa mu yaamari ti e xa Isirayila ɲama kɔnti? N tan nan yunubi rabaxi, n tan nan yi fe kobi niyaxi. Ɲama tan munse rabaxi? N Marigi Alatala, i xa n tan nun ma denbaya halaki, i xa i xa ɲama lu naa.»<verse eid="1CH 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 21:18" />Alatala xa malekɛ naxa a masen Gadi bɛ a xa a fala Dawuda bɛ, a xa te sɛrɛxɛbade yailande Alatala bɛ Oronan Yebusuka xa lonyi ma. <verse eid="1CH 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 21:19" />Dawuda naxa te naa alɔ Gadi a fala a bɛ Alatala xili ra ki naxɛ.<verse eid="1CH 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 21:20" />Oronan to nu naa lonyi ma, a mɛngi bɔnbɔfe, a naxa a mafindi, a fa malekɛ to. A tan nun a xa di naanie naxa e nɔxun. <verse eid="1CH 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 21:21" />Na waxati, Dawuda fan nu sigafe Oronan yire. Oronan to a to, a naxa keli lonyi ma, a sa a felen bɔxi ma Dawuda bun ma. <verse eid="1CH 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 21:22" />Dawuda naxa a fala Oronan bɛ, «N wama yi lonyi sarafe i ma, alako n xa sɛrɛxɛbade ti Alatala bɛ. A mati n ma a sare ra, alako fure ɲaaxi xa ɲɔn ɲama ma.» <verse eid="1CH 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 21:23" />Oronan naxa Dawuda yaabi, «Mangɛ, a tongo. N marigi xa a waxɔnfe raba a ra. N bara yi ningee fan so i yi ra, e xa findi sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra. Yi sarɛtie nɔma gande yege ra, yi mɛngi fan xa findi sɛrɛxɛ ra. N bara yi birin fi i ma.»<verse eid="1CH 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 21:24" />Kɔnɔ mangɛ Dawuda naxa a fala Oronan bɛ, «Ade, n wama a sarafe nɛ kɔbiri ra naxan lanma sɛriyɛ ki ma. N mu se bama sɛrɛxɛ ra Alatala bɛ, naxan findima i tan harige ra. N mu nɔma sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi bade n mu naxan sare baxi.» <verse eid="1CH 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 21:25" />Na kui Dawuda naxa xɛɛma kilo solofere fi Oronan ma na lonyi xa fe ra. <verse eid="1CH 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 21:26" />Dawuda naxa sɛrɛxɛbade ti mɛnni Alatala bɛ, a fa sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi nun xanunteya sɛrɛxɛ ba. A to Alatala maxandi, Alatala naxa a yaabi tɛ ra naxan sinxi sɛrɛxɛbade ma keli koore ma. <verse eid="1CH 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 21:27" />Na tɛmui Alatala naxa wɔyɛn malekɛ bɛ, a fa santidɛgɛma raso a tɛɛ i.<verse eid="1CH 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 21:28" />Dawuda nu sɛrɛxɛ bama Oronan Yebusuka xa lonyi nan ma sɔnɔn, barima a nu bara a kolon a Alatala a yaabima mɛnni nɛ. <verse eid="1CH 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 21:29" />Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira, Annabi Munsa naxan yailan gbengberenyi ma, a nun sɛrɛxɛbade sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi bama dɛnnaxɛ, nee nu na yire itexi nde nɛ Gabayon na waxati. <verse eid="1CH 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 21:30" />Kɔnɔ Dawuda mu nu nɔma sode naa, a xa wɔyɛn Ala ra, barima a nu hɛnmɛxi Alatala xa malekɛ xa santidɛgɛma ra.<verse eid="1CH 21:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1CH 22" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi fɔlɔfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 22:1" />Dawuda naxa a masen, «Won Marigi Alatala xa banxi xa ti be, a nun sɛrɛxɛbade, sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi bama dɛnnaxɛ.»<verse eid="1CH 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 22:2" />Dawuda naxa yaamari fi, xɔɲɛ konyi birin naxee sabatixi Isirayila bɔxi ma, e xa malan. A naxa e findi gɛmɛ xabamae ra Ala xa banxi xa wali xa fe ra. <verse eid="1CH 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 22:3" />Dawuda naxa wure gbegbe fen, naxan findima lantumae nun naadɛ gbaku see ra. A naxa yɔxui gbegbe fan fen naxan mu nu nɔma maniyade a gboe xa fe ra. <verse eid="1CH 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 22:4" />Sidɔnkae nun Tirekae naxa Dawuda mali, a naxa wuri fanyi gbegbe sɔtɔ. Na wuri mɔɔli xili nɛ sɛdiri. <verse eid="1CH 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 22:5" />Dawuda nu fa a fala, «N ma di Sulemani dimɛdi na a ra, a mu wali kolon sinden. Hɔrɔmɔbanxi naxan tima Alatala bɛ, na lanma a xa tofan, a xa rayabu, a xili xa gbo si birin ya ma.» Na kui, Dawuda se gbegbe malan nɛ na banxi tima naxan na beenu a xa faxa<verse eid="1CH 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 22:6" />Dawuda naxa a xa di Sulemani xili, a a fala a bɛ a xa banxi ti Isirayila Marigi Alatala bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 22:7" />A naxɛ, «N ma di, natɛ nu na n bɛ n xa banxi ti n Marigi Alatala bɛ, <verse eid="1CH 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 22:8" />kɔnɔ Alatala bara yi masen n bɛ yi ki, ‹I bara wuli ifili a gbe ra n ya i i xa yihadi geree kui, i mixie gbegbe faxa. Na nan a ra, i tan nu lan i xa banxi ti n bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 22:9" />Kɔnɔ i fama di nde sɔtɔde, naxan findima bɔɲɛsa mixi ra, n malabui fima naxan ma a yaxuie xa fe ra. A xili fama falade Sulemani. Isirayila luma bɔɲɛsa nun maraxarɛ kui a xa simaya birin kui. <verse eid="1CH 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 22:10" />A tan nan fama banxi tide n bɛ, a fa findi n ma di ra, n fan findi a baba ra. A xa mangɛya kibanyi buma abadan Isirayila.›»<verse eid="1CH 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 22:11" />«Yakɔsi, n ma di, Alatala xa lu i sɛɛti ma, alako i xa i Marigi Alatala xa banxi ti sɔɔnɛya ra alɔ a a falaxi i xa fe ra ki naxɛ. <verse eid="1CH 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 22:12" />Alatala xa lɔnni nun xaxili fanyi fi i ma a i tima mangɛ ra tɛmui naxɛ Isirayila bɔxi ma, alako i xa i Marigi Alatala xa sɛriyɛ rabatu. <verse eid="1CH 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 22:13" />Fe birin fama nɛ sɔɔnɛyade i bɛ xa i Alatala xa sɛriyɛ nun a xa yaamarie rabatuma, a naxee soxi Annabi Munsa yi ra Isirayila bɛ. I xa i sɛnbɛ so, i xa limaniya. I naxa gaaxu fefe ya ra, i bɔɲɛ naxa mini.»<verse eid="1CH 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 22:14" />«N ma katɛ kui, n bara xɛɛma kilo miliyɔn saxan, kilo wulu kɛmɛ naani malan Alatala xa banxi xa fe ra. N man bara gbeti kilo miliyɔn tongo saxan nun naani malan. Yɔxui nun wure bara gbo han na kɔnti mu nɔma kolonde. N bara wuri nun gɛmɛ fan fen. I man fama nde sade na xun. <verse eid="1CH 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 22:15" />Walikɛ gbegbe na i yi ra naxee fata gɛmɛ xabade, naxee fata gɛmɛ nun wuri masolide. E wali mɔɔli birin kolon. <verse eid="1CH 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 22:16" />Xɛɛma, gbeti, yɔxui, nun wure na i yi ra han a bara dangi a i. Keli, i xa wali suxu keren na! Alatala xa i mali.»<verse eid="1CH 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 22:17" />Dawuda naxa a fala Isirayila kuntigi birin bɛ, e xa fa a xa di Sulemani mali. A naxa a fala e bɛ, <verse eid="1CH 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 22:18" />«Wo Marigi Alatala mu na wo fɔxɔ ra? A mu bɔɲɛsa fixi wo ma wo yaxui birin ya ra? A bara bekae sa n bɛlɛxɛ i. Yi bɔxi bara findi Alatala nun a xa ɲama gbe ra. <verse eid="1CH 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 22:19" />Wo xa wo Marigi Alatala fen wo bɔɲɛ nun wo nii birin na. Wo keli, wo xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi sɛniyɛnxi ti wo Marigi Alatala bɛ, alako wo xa fa Alatala xa saatɛ kankira nun a xa se sɛniyɛnxie raso Ala xa banxi kui.»<verse eid="1CH 22:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1CH 23" />
  <para style="s">Lewi bɔnsɔɛ xa kɔnti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 23:1" />Dawuda to bara gɛ foride, a naxa a xa di Sulemani sugandi Isirayila mangɛ ra. <verse eid="1CH 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 23:2" />A naxa Isirayila kuntigie, sɛrɛxɛdubɛe, nun Lewikae malan. <verse eid="1CH 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 23:3" />E naxa Lewikae kɔnti, naxee nu bara ɲɛ tongo saxan sɔtɔ. E kɔnti naxa siga xɛmɛ wulu tongo saxan nun solomasaxan. <verse eid="1CH 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 23:4" />Dawuda naxa a fala, «N bara mixi wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani ba, e xa e ɲɛngi sa Alatala xa banxi wali rabafe xɔn. Mixi wulu senni xa findi kiitisae ra. Mixi wulu naani xa findi naadɛ kantɛe ra. <verse eid="1CH 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 23:5" />Mixi wulu naani xa Alatala matɔxɔ maxasee xui ra, n naxee yailanxi a matɔxɔ se ra.»<verse eid="1CH 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 23:6" />Dawuda naxa Lewikae itaxun xundɛ ma, e benba Lewi xa die ki ma: Gerison, Kehati, nun Merari. <verse eid="1CH 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 23:7" />Gerison xa die: Ladana nun Simeyi. <verse eid="1CH 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 23:8" />Ladana xa die: Yɛxiyɛli, di singe, Setama nun Yoweli, e mixi saxan. <verse eid="1CH 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 23:9" />Simeyi xa die: Selomoti, Xasiyɛli, nun Xarani, e mixi saxan. Ladana xa denbaya kuntigie nan na ki.<verse eid="1CH 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 23:10" />Simeyi xa die: Yaxati, Sisa, Yeyusu nun Beriya. Simeyi xa di naani nan na ki. <verse eid="1CH 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 23:11" />Yaxati, di singe, Sisa, di firin nde. Yeyusu nun Beriya mu di gbegbe sɔtɔ. E naxa findi denbaya keren na.<verse eid="1CH 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 23:12" />Kehati xa die: Amarama, Yisehari, Xebiron, nun Yusiyɛli, e mixi naani. <verse eid="1CH 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 23:13" />Amarama xa die: Haruna nun Munsa. Haruna naxa findi Ala xa mixi sɛniyɛnxi ra, a nun a bɔnsɔɛ abadan, alako e xa surayi ba sɛrɛxɛ ra Alatala bɛ, e xa a xa wali gbɛtɛ raba, e man xa duba mixi bɛ Ala xili ra tɛmui birin. <verse eid="1CH 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 23:14" />Munsa findi Ala xa mixi nan na. A xa die naxa lu Lewi bɔnsɔɛe ya ma. <verse eid="1CH 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 23:15" />Munsa xa die: Gerisomi nun Eliyeseri. <verse eid="1CH 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 23:16" />Gerisomi xa die: Sebuweli, di singe. <verse eid="1CH 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 23:17" />Eliyeseri xa die: Rexabiya, di singe. Eliyeseri mu di gbɛtɛ sɔtɔ, kɔnɔ Rexabiya naxa di gbegbe bari. <verse eid="1CH 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 23:18" />Yisehari xa die: Selomiti, di singe. <verse eid="1CH 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 23:19" />Xebiron xa die: Yeriya, di singe, Amaraya, di firin nde, Yaxasiyeli, di saxan nde, nun Yekameyami, di naani nde. <verse eid="1CH 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 23:20" />Yusiyɛli xa die: Mike, di singe, nun Yisiya, di firin nde.<verse eid="1CH 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 23:21" />Merari xa die: Maxali nun Musi. Maxali xa die: Eleyasari nun Kisi. <verse eid="1CH 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 23:22" />Eleyasari faxa nɛ, a mu di xɛmɛ yo lu, kɔnɔ a di ginɛe tan lu nɛ. Kisi xa die naxa e dɔxɔ ginɛ ra, barima e dɛxɔe nan nu e ra. <verse eid="1CH 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 23:23" />Musi xa die: Maxali, Ederi nun Yerimoti, e di saxan.<verse eid="1CH 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 23:24" />Yee nan findi Lewi bɔnsɔɛe ra denbaya xunyie ki ma. E birin kɔntixi keren kerenyi ra. E nu walima Alatala xa banxi kui kabi e na ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn. <verse eid="1CH 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 23:25" />Dawuda nu bara a fala, «Isirayila Marigi Alatala bara bɔɲɛsa fi a xa ɲama ma. E xa lu Darisalamu abadan. <verse eid="1CH 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 23:26" />Lewikae mu fama Ala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira nun a yirabasee xaninde sɔnɔn.» <verse eid="1CH 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 23:27" />Dawuda xa natɛ dɔnxɔɛ nan na ki, Lewikae kɔntife naxee bara ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 23:28" />E nu Haruna xa die malima Alatala xa banxi wali ra, alɔ mɛɛnife tɛtɛ nun konkoe ma, se rasɛniyɛnfe, wali xunxuri rabafe Ala xa banxi kui, <verse eid="1CH 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 23:29" />taami yailanfe naxan bama sɛrɛxɛ ra Ala bɛ, farin dinfe naxan findima sɛrɛxɛ ra, taami lɛbinitare yailanfe, nun donse mɔɔli birin nafalafe. <verse eid="1CH 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 23:30" />E nu lanma e xa Alatala matɔxɔ gɛɛsɛgɛ nun nunmare birin. <verse eid="1CH 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 23:31" />E man nu sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie bama Alatala bɛ malabui lɔxɔɛe ma, Kike Nɛɛnɛ Sali, nun sali xungbe waxati. E nu lanma e xa Alatala rabatu a sɛriyɛ ki ma. <verse eid="1CH 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 23:32" />E tan nan nu Kiri Banxi Naralande nun yire sɛniyɛnxi kantama. E man nu e ngaxakerenyi Haruna xa die xa yaamari rabatuma Alatala xa banxi wali rabafe ma.<verse eid="1CH 23:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1CH 24" />
  <para style="s">Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe itaxunfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 24:1" />Haruna nu bara di naani sɔtɔ: Nadabo, Abihu, Eleyasari, nun Itamari. <verse eid="1CH 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 24:2" />Nadabo nun Abihu singe naxa faxa e baba bɛ. E mu di yo bari. Eleyasari nun Itamari nan nu na sɛrɛxɛdubɛe ra. <verse eid="1CH 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 24:3" />Sadɔki, Eleyasari xa di, nun Aximeleki, Itamari xa die, naxa Dawuda mali Haruna xa die itaxunfe ra e wali ki ma.<verse eid="1CH 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 24:4" />Mangɛe nu wuya Eleyasari xa die nan ya ma, dangi Itamari xa die ra. Na nan a to e naxa Eleyasari xa die findi denbaya fu nun senni ra. Itamari xa die naxa findi denbaya solomasaxan na. <verse eid="1CH 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 24:5" />E naxa e sugandi Ala xa mali ra, barima Eleyasari xa die nun Itamari xa die birin findixi Ala xa walikɛe nan na. <verse eid="1CH 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 24:6" />Netaneeli xa di Semaya Lewika nan nu e xilie sɛbɛma mangɛ, kuntigie, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ Sadɔki, Abiyatari xa di Aximeleki, nun sɛrɛxɛdubɛe xa denbaya xunyie, nun Lewikae ya xɔri. E naxa denbaya keren sugandi Eleyasari xa die ya ma, e man naxa keren sugandi Itamari xa die ya ma.<verse eid="1CH 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 24:7" />Ala naxa a ragiri denbayae xa sugandi yi ki: a singe Yehoyaribu, a firin nde Yɛdaya, <verse eid="1CH 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 24:8" />a saxan nde Xarima, a naani nde Seyorimi, <verse eid="1CH 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 24:9" />a suuli nde Malakiya, a senni nde Miyamin, <verse eid="1CH 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 24:10" />a solofere nde Hakɔsi, a solomasaxan nde Abiya, <verse eid="1CH 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 24:11" />a solomanaani nde Yosuwe, a fu nde Sɛkanaya, <verse eid="1CH 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 24:12" />a fu nun keren nde Eliyasibu, a fu nun firin nde Yakimi, <verse eid="1CH 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 24:13" />a fu nun saxan nde Xupa, a fu nun naani nde Yesebeyabi, <verse eid="1CH 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 24:14" />a fu nun suuli nde Biliga, a fu nun senni nde Imeri, <verse eid="1CH 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 24:15" />a fu nun solofere nde Xesiri, a fu nun solomasaxan nde Hapisɛsi, <verse eid="1CH 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 24:16" />a fu nun solomanaani nde Petaxiya, a mɔxɔɲɛn nde Yesekiyeli, <verse eid="1CH 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 24:17" />a mɔxɔɲɛn nun keren nde Yakin, a mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin nde Gamulu, <verse eid="1CH 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 24:18" />a mɔxɔɲɛn nun saxan nde Dɛlaya, a mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani nde Maasiya.<verse eid="1CH 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 24:19" />A nu lan e xa Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa wali suxu na ki nɛ, alɔ e benba Haruna a fala e bɛ ki naxɛ. Isirayila Marigi Alatala nu bara na yaamari so Haruna yi ra.<verse eid="1CH 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 24:20" />Lewi bɔnsɔɛ gbɛtɛe nan ya. Amarama xa die: Subayeli. Subayeli xa die: Yexedeya. <verse eid="1CH 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 24:21" />Rexabiya xa die: Yisiya, di singe. <verse eid="1CH 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 24:22" />Yisehari xa die: Selomoti. Selomoti xa die: Yaxati. <verse eid="1CH 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 24:23" />Xebiron xa die: Yeriya, di singe, Amaraya, di firin nde, Yaxasiyeli, di saxan nde, Yekameyami, a xa di naani nde. <verse eid="1CH 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 24:24" />Yusiyɛli xa die: Mike. Mike xa die: Samiri. <verse eid="1CH 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 24:25" />Mike xunya: Yisiya. Yisiya xa die: Sakari. <verse eid="1CH 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 24:26" />Merari xa die: Maxali nun Musi a nun a xa mamadi Yaasiyahu. <verse eid="1CH 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 24:27" />Merari xa mamadie: Yaasiyahu, Sohami, Sakuru, nun Ibiri. <verse eid="1CH 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 24:28" />Maxali xa die: Eleyasari. Eleyasari mu di yo sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 24:29" />Kisi xa die: Yerameeli. <verse eid="1CH 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 24:30" />Musi xa die: Maxali, Ederi, nun Yerimoti. Lewi xa die nan ya a denbaya ki ma.<verse eid="1CH 24:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 24:31" />E fan sugandixi Ala xa mali nan na alɔ e ngaxakerenyie Haruna xa die. Na raba mangɛ Dawuda, Sadɔki, Aximeleki, sɛrɛxɛdubɛe xa denbaya xunyie, nun Lewikae ya xɔri. Na kui Eleyasari nun Itamari xa denbayae birin lan.<verse eid="1CH 24:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1CH 25" />
  <para style="s">Bɛɛtibae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 25:1" />Dawuda nun sɔɔri mangɛe naxa Asafi, Heman, nun Yedutun bɔnsɔɛe sugandi e xa namiɲɔnmɛ masenyi ti bɛɛti daaxi, kɔrae nun maxasee xui ra. Xɛmɛe xilie nan ya naxee nu na wali rabama: <verse eid="1CH 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 25:2" />Asafi xa die: Sakuru, Yusufu, Netaniya, nun Asareela. Asafi xa die, naxee nu na a xa yaamari bun ma, naxee nu namiɲɔnmɛ masenyi tima mangɛ bɛ: <verse eid="1CH 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 25:3" />Yedutun xa die: Gɛdalaya, Seri, Yɛsaya, Simeyi, Xasabiya, nun Matitiya. Na mixi senni naxa lu e baba Yedutun xa yaamari bun ma. Yedutun nu namiɲɔnmɛ masenyi tima kɔra xui ra, alako a xa Alatala matɔxɔ, a xa a tantu.<verse eid="1CH 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 25:4" />Heman xa die: Buukiya, Mataniya, Yusiyɛli, Sebuweli, Yerimoti, Xananiya, Xanani, Eliyata, Gidaliti, Romanti Eseri, Yosobekasa, Maloti, Hotiri, Maxasiyoti. <verse eid="1CH 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 25:5" />Yi mixi birin findixi Heman xa die nan na, naxan nu Ala xui madangima mangɛ bɛ. Ala naxa sɛnbɛ fi a ma, a xa di fu nun naani sɔtɔ, a nun di ginɛ saxan. <verse eid="1CH 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 25:6" />Nee birin nu na e baba xa yaamari bun ma, e xa bɛɛti ba kɔrae xui ra Alatala xa banxi kui. Asafi, Yedutun, nun Heman nu na mangɛ xa yaamari nan bun ma. <verse eid="1CH 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 25:7" />Yi karamɔxɔ naxee fata bɛɛti bade Alatala bɛ, e findi mixi kɛmɛ firin mixi tongo solomasaxan nun solomasaxan nan na. <verse eid="1CH 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 25:8" />E birin sugandixi Ala xa mali nan na e xa wali kɛɲa ma, tagi rasa yo mu nu na a lanmadi, a xungbe, a karamɔxɔɛ, nun a xarandi tagi.<verse eid="1CH 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 25:9" />Ala naxa a ragiri e xa sugandi yi ki: A singe, Asafi xa di Yusufu. A firin nde, Gɛdalaya, a xunyae, nun a xa die, e mixi fu nun firin. <verse eid="1CH 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 25:10" />A saxan nde, Sakuru, a xa die, nun a xunyae, e mixi fu nun firin. <verse eid="1CH 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 25:11" />A naani nde, Yisiri, a xa die, nun a xunyae, e mixi fu nun firin. <verse eid="1CH 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 25:12" />A suuli nde, Netaniya, a xa die, nun a xunyae, e mixi fu nun firin. <verse eid="1CH 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 25:13" />A senni nde, Buukiya, a xa die, nun a xunyae, e mixi fu nun firin. <verse eid="1CH 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 25:14" />A solofere nde, Yesarela, a xa die, nun a xunyae, e mixi fu nun firin. <verse eid="1CH 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 25:15" />A solomasaxan nde, Yɛsaya, a xa die, nun a xunyae, e mixi fu nun firin. <verse eid="1CH 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 25:16" />A solomanaani nde, Mataniya, a xa die, nun a xunyae, e mixi fu nun firin. <verse eid="1CH 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 25:17" />A fu nde, Simeyi, a xa die, nun a xunyae, e mixi fu nun firin. <verse eid="1CH 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 25:18" />A fu nun keren nde, Asarɛli, a xa die, nun a xunyae, e mixi fu nun firin. <verse eid="1CH 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 25:19" />A fu nun firin nde, Xasabiya, a xa die, nun a xunyae, e mixi fu nun firin. <verse eid="1CH 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 25:20" />A fu nun saxan nde, Subayeli, a xa die, nun a xunyae, e mixi fu nun firin. <verse eid="1CH 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 25:21" />A fu nun naani nde, Matitiya, a xa die, nun a xunyae, e mixi fu nun firin. <verse eid="1CH 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 25:22" />A fu nun suuli nde, Yerimoti, a xa die, nun a xunyae, e mixi fu nun firin. <verse eid="1CH 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 25:23" />A fu nun senni nde, Xananiya, a xa die, nun a xunyae, e mixi fu nun firin. <verse eid="1CH 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 25:24" />A fu nun solofere nde, Yosobekasa, a xa die, nun a xunyae, e mixi fu nun firin. <verse eid="1CH 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 25:25" />A fu nun solomasaxan nde, Xanani, a xa die, nun a xunyae, e mixi fu nun firin. <verse eid="1CH 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 25:26" />A fu nun solomanaani nde, Maloti, a xa die, nun a xunyae, e mixi fu nun firin. <verse eid="1CH 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 25:27" />A mɔxɔɲɛn nde, Eliyata, a xa die, nun a xunyae, e mixi fu nun firin. <verse eid="1CH 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 25:28" />A mɔxɔɲɛn nun keren nde, Hotiri, a xa die, nun a xunyae, e mixi fu nun firin. <verse eid="1CH 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 25:29" />A mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin nde, Gidaliti, a xa die, nun a xunyae, e mixi fu nun firin. <verse eid="1CH 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 25:30" />A mɔxɔɲɛn nun saxan nde, Maxasiyoti, a xa die, nun a xunyae, e mixi fu nun firin. <verse eid="1CH 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 25:31" />A mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani nde, Romanti Eseri, a xa die, nun a xunyae, e mixi fu nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 25:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1CH 26" />
  <para style="s">Hɔrɔmɔbanxi naadɛ kantɛe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 26:1" />Naadɛ kantɛe nan ya: Kore xa die naxan baba findi Asafi ra: Meselemiya. <verse eid="1CH 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 26:2" />Meselemiya xa die: Sakari nan na di singe ra, Yediyayeli, nan na a firin nde ra, Sebadaya nan na a saxan nde ra, <verse eid="1CH 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 26:3" />Yataniyɛli nan na a naani nde ra, Elama nan na a suuli nde ra, Yehoxanan nan na a senni nde ra, Eliyehowenayi nan na a solofere nde ra. <verse eid="1CH 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 26:4" />Obedo Edon xa die: Semaya, di singe, Yehosabadi di firin nde, Yowa di saxan nde, Sakara di naani nde, Netaneeli, di suuli nde, <verse eid="1CH 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 26:5" />Amiyɛli, di senni nde, Isakari, di solofere nde, Pewuletayi, di solomasaxan nde. Ala nu bara baraka sa Obedo Edon xa fe. <verse eid="1CH 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 26:6" />A xa di singe Semaya naxa di xɛmɛe bari naxee findixi kuntigie ra e xa denbayae xun ma barima e sɛnbɛ nu gbo. <verse eid="1CH 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 26:7" />Semaya xa die: Otini, Refayeli, Obedo, Elesabada, nun e xunyae Elihu nun Semakiya, xɛmɛ gbangbalanyie. <verse eid="1CH 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 26:8" />Yi mixi tongo senni nun firin birin baba nu lanxi Obedo Edon nan ma. E sɛnbɛ nu gbo ki fanyi Ala xa wali kui.<verse eid="1CH 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 26:9" />Meselemiya xa die nun a xunyae findixi mixi fu nun solomasaxan nan na. E sɛnbɛ fan nu gbo. <verse eid="1CH 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 26:10" />Merari xa di Xosa naxa di xɛmɛe bari: Simiri, a baba naxan findi xunyi ra hali di singe to mu nu a ra. <verse eid="1CH 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 26:11" />Xilikiya, a firin nde, Tebaliya, a saxan nde, Sakari, a naani nde. Xosa xa die nun a xunyae nu lanxi mixi fu nun saxan nan ma. <verse eid="1CH 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 26:12" />Yi mixi birin nun e xunyae findixi naadɛ kantɛe nan na Alatala xa banxi kui. <verse eid="1CH 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 26:13" />E nu luma mixi sugandi ra Ala xa mali ra alako e xa a kolon nde lan a xa naadɛ mundun kanta. Denbaya birin, mixi xuri nun mixi xungbe, e birin nu na na kɔnti kui.<verse eid="1CH 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 26:14" />Ala naxa a ragiri sogetede naadɛ xa ilan Selemiya ra. Kɔɔla naadɛ naxa ilan a xa di Sakari ra, naxan findixi lɔnnila ra. <verse eid="1CH 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 26:15" />Yirefanyi naadɛ naxa ilan Obedo Edon na. A xa die fan naxa lan banxi ma see ragatama dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="1CH 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 26:16" />Sogegorode naadɛ naxa ilan Supimi nun Xosa ra Alatala xa maragiri saabui ra. E naxa Saaleketi naadɛ fan kanta, naxan nu na kira ma naxan tema. Xundɛ firin nu na mɛnni, e ya rafindixi e boore ma. <verse eid="1CH 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 26:17" />Lewika senni nu na sogetede biri, mixi naani kɔɔla biri, mixi naani yirefanyi biri, mixi naani see ragatama banxi naxan kui, yire firin, <verse eid="1CH 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 26:18" />sogegorode biri, mixi naani nu na kira dɛ ra, mixi firin banxi sode dɛ ra. <verse eid="1CH 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 26:19" />Naadɛ kantɛe nan na ki naxee kelixi Kore nun Merari xa die ya ma.<verse eid="1CH 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 26:20" />Lewikae nan ya naxee nu e ɲɛngi sama naafuli nun se sɛniyɛnxie xɔn ma naxee ragataxi Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui. <verse eid="1CH 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 26:21" />Ladana xa di naxee fatanxi Gerison bɔnsɔɛ ra Ladana saabui ra, e xa denbaya xunyie nu lanxi Yexiyeli nan ma. <verse eid="1CH 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 26:22" />Yexiyeli xa die fan, Setama nun a xunya Yoweli, nu e ɲɛngi saxi naafuli xɔn ma naxan nagataxi Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui.<verse eid="1CH 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 26:23" />Amaramakae, Yiseharikae, Xebironkae, nun Yusiyɛlikae <verse eid="1CH 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 26:24" />naxa Gerisomi xa di Sebuweli, Munsa xa mamadi, sugandi a xa mɛɛni naafuli ma, <verse eid="1CH 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 26:25" />e nun a bari boore naxee fatanxi Eliyeseri xabilɛ ra. E findi Eliyeseri xa di Rexabiya nan na, na fan xa di Yɛsaya, na fan xa di Yorami, na fan xa di Sikiri, nun na fan xa di Selomiti. <verse eid="1CH 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 26:26" />Selomiti nun a bari booree nan nu e ɲɛngi sama naafuli nun se sɛniyɛnxie xɔn ma, mangɛ Dawuda naxee radaxa xabilɛ mixi wulu yarerati, mixi kɛmɛ yarerati, nun sɔɔri xunyie nan nee fixi Ala ma. <verse eid="1CH 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 26:27" />E nu bara e harige ba Alatala xa banxi bɛ e naxan sɔtɔ gere kui. <verse eid="1CH 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 26:28" />Selomiti nun a xunyae man nu e ɲɛngi sama naafuli fan xɔn ma, Annabi Samuweli, Kisi xa di Sɔlu, Neri xa di Abeneri, nun Seruya xa di Yowaba naxan fixi Ala ma. <verse eid="1CH 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 26:29" />Kenaniya nun a xunyae, naxee findi Yisehari bɔnsɔɛ ra, nan nu e ɲɛngi saxi kiiti safe xɔn ma Darisalamu fari ma Isirayila. <verse eid="1CH 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 26:30" />Xasabiya nun a xunyae, naxee nu na Xebiron, xɛmɛ gbangbalanyie, e mixi wulu keren kɛmɛ solofere, e nu e ɲɛngi sama Isirayila bɔxi xɔn ma naxan nu na Yurudɛn naakiri ma sogegorode mabiri. E nu e ɲɛngi sama Alatala nun mangɛ xa wali xɔn ma mɛnni biri. <verse eid="1CH 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 26:31" />Yeriya findi Xebiron mangɛ nan na a xabilɛ ki ma. Dawuda xa mangɛya ɲɛ tongo naani nde, mixi ndee naxa taruxuie mato, e fa a kolon xɛmɛ gbangbalanyie na Yaasɛri, Galadi bɔxi ma. <verse eid="1CH 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 26:32" />A ngaxakerenyi gbangbalanyie nu lanxi mixi wulu firin kɛmɛ solofere nan ma, e birin xabilɛ xunyie. Mangɛ Dawuda naxa e findi Ruben, Gadi, nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti keren xunyie ra.<verse eid="1CH 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1CH 27" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila sɔɔrie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 27:1" />Isirayila sɔɔrie xunyie nan ya naxee findi denbaya xunyie ra. E tan nan nu findixi mangɛ xa sɔɔri gali xunyie ra, sɔɔri wulu nun sɔɔri kɛmɛ ki ma. Kike yo kike xɛmɛ wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani nu sɔɔri wali rabama.<verse eid="1CH 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 27:2" />Sabadiyɛli xa di Yasobeyami findi xundɛ singe xa mangɛ nan na, ɲɛ kike singe. Xɛmɛ wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani nu na a xa yaamari bun ma. <verse eid="1CH 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 27:3" />Sabadiyɛli findi Peresi xa di nde nan na. A findi sɔɔri birin xa mangɛ nan na ɲɛ kike singe.<verse eid="1CH 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 27:4" />Dodayi Axowaka findi xundɛ firin nde mangɛ nan na ɲɛ kike firin nde. Mikiloti naxa findi a xa sɔɔrie xunyi ra. Xɛmɛ wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani nu na a xa yaamari bun ma.<verse eid="1CH 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 27:5" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ Yehoyada xa di Bɛnaya findi xundɛ saxan nde mangɛ nan na ɲɛ kike saxan nde. Xɛmɛ wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani nu na a xa yaamari bun ma. <verse eid="1CH 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 27:6" />Bɛnaya nan nu na Dawuda xa sɔɔri tongo saxanyie xunyi ra. A xa di Amisabadi nu na a baba xa yaamari bun ma.<verse eid="1CH 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 27:7" />Yowaba xunya Asahɛli findi xundɛ naani nde mangɛ nan na ɲɛ kike naani nde. A xa di Sebadaya naxa findi a ɲɔxɔɛ ra. Xɛmɛ wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani nu na a xa yaamari bun ma.<verse eid="1CH 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 27:8" />Samehuti Yisiraka findi xundɛ suuli nde mangɛ nan na ɲɛ kike suuli nde. Xɛmɛ wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani nu na a xa yaamari bun ma.<verse eid="1CH 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 27:9" />Ikesi xa di Ira Tekowaka findixi xundɛ senni nde mangɛ nan na ɲɛ kike senni nde. Xɛmɛ wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani nu na a xa yaamari bun ma.<verse eid="1CH 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 27:10" />Xɛlɛsi Pelonka naxan fatan Efirami bɔnsɔɛ ra findi xundɛ solofere nde mangɛ nan na ɲɛ kike solofere nde. Xɛmɛ wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani nu na a xa yaamari bun ma.<verse eid="1CH 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 27:11" />Sibekayi Xusaka naxan fatan Sera xabilɛ ra findi xundɛ solomasaxan nde mangɛ nan na ɲɛ kike solomasaxan nde. Xɛmɛ wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani nu na a xa yaamari bun ma.<verse eid="1CH 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 27:12" />Abiyeseri Anatɔtika naxan fatan Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ ra findi xundɛ solomanaani nde mangɛ nan na ɲɛ kike solomanaani nde. Xɛmɛ wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani nu na a xa yaamari bun ma.<verse eid="1CH 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 27:13" />Maharayi Netofaka naxan fatan Sera xabilɛ ra findi xundɛ fu nde mangɛ nan na ɲɛ kike fu nde. Xɛmɛ wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani nu na a xa yaamari bun ma.<verse eid="1CH 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 27:14" />Bɛnaya Piratonka naxan fatan Efirami bɔnsɔɛ ra findi xundɛ fu nun keren nde mangɛ nan na ɲɛ kike fu nun keren nde. Xɛmɛ wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani nu na a xa yaamari bun ma.<verse eid="1CH 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 27:15" />Xeledayi Netofaka naxan fatan Otiniyeli xabilɛ ra findi xundɛ fu nun firin nde mangɛ nan na ɲɛ kike fu nun firin nde. Xɛmɛ wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani nu na a xa yaamari bun ma.<verse eid="1CH 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 27:16" />Isirayila bɔnsɔɛe xa sɔɔrie xa mangɛe nan ya: Ruben bɔnsɔɛ xun ma, Sikiri xa di Eliyeseri. Simeyɔn bɔnsɔɛ xun ma, Maaka xa di Sɛfataya, <verse eid="1CH 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 27:17" />Lewi bɔnsɔɛ xun ma, Kemuweli xa di Xasabiya. Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ Sadɔki nan nu na Haruna xabilɛ xun ma. <verse eid="1CH 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 27:18" />Yudaya bɔnsɔɛ xun ma, Dawuda taara Elihu. Isakari bɔnsɔɛ xun ma, Mikayeli xa di Omeri. <verse eid="1CH 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 27:19" />Sabulon bɔnsɔɛ xun ma, Abadiyasi xa di Yisemaya. Nafatali bɔnsɔɛ xun ma, Asiriyɛli xa di Yerimoti. <verse eid="1CH 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 27:20" />Efirami bɔnsɔɛ xun ma, Asasiya xa di Hoseya. Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti keren xun ma, Pɛdaya xa di Yoweli. <verse eid="1CH 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 27:21" />Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti boore xun ma sogetede biri, Sakari xa di Ido. Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ xun ma, Abeneri xa di Yaasiyɛli. <verse eid="1CH 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 27:22" />Dana bɔnsɔɛ xun ma, Yeroxama xa di Asarɛli. Isirayila bɔnsɔɛe xa sɔɔrie xa mangɛe nan na ki.<verse eid="1CH 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 27:23" />Dawuda mu mixie kɔnti, naxee nu bara gɛ ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn sɔtɔde, barima Alatala nu bara a masen a Isirayilakae wuyama nɛ alɔ tunbuie. <verse eid="1CH 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 27:24" />Seruya xa di Yowaba nu bara Isirayilakae kɔnti fɔlɔ, kɔnɔ a mu a raɲɔn Alatala xa xɔnɛ xa fe ra Isirayila ma. Na kɔnti mu sɛbɛxi Dawuda xa taruxui buki kui.<verse eid="1CH 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 27:25" />Adiyeli xa di Asamafeti findi mangɛ xa naafuli ragatɛ nan na. Yusiya xa di Yonatan fan findi mangɛ xa naafuli ragatɛ nan na Darisalamu fari ma, daaxa nun taa gbɛtɛe kui. <verse eid="1CH 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 27:26" />Kelubu xa di Esiri findi mangɛ xa xɛ sae xunyi nan na. <verse eid="1CH 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 27:27" />Simeyi Ramatika nan nu a ɲɔxɔ sama mangɛ xa wɛni bilie xɔn ma. Sabidi Sefamika nan fan nu a ɲɔxɔ sama mangɛ xa wɛni ragatadee xɔn ma. <verse eid="1CH 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 27:28" />Bali Xanan Gederika nan nu mɛɛnima mangɛ xa oliwi nun sikomoro xɛe ma Sefela bɔxi ma. Yowasi nan fan nu mɛɛnima mangɛ xa ture ragatadee ma. <verse eid="1CH 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 27:29" />Sitirayi Sarɔnka nan nu mɛɛnima mangɛ xa xuruse xungbee ma Sarɔn bɔxi ma. Adalayi xa di Safati nan fan nu mɛɛnima mangɛ xa xuruse xungbee ma gulunba kui. <verse eid="1CH 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 27:30" />Sumayila xa di Obili nan nu mɛɛnima mangɛ xa ɲɔxɔmɛe ma. Yexedeya Meronotika nan fan nu mɛɛnima mangɛ xa sofalee ma. <verse eid="1CH 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 27:31" />Yasisi Hagarika nan nu mɛɛnima mangɛ xa xuruse lanmae ma. Yi mixie birin nu e ɲɛngi sama mangɛ Dawuda harige nan xɔn ma.<verse eid="1CH 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 27:32" />Mangɛ Dawuda baba xunya Yonatan findi mixi rasi, lɔnnila, nun sɛbɛliti nan na. Xakimoni xa di Yɛxiyɛli nan nu mɛɛnima mangɛ xa die ma. <verse eid="1CH 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 27:33" />Axitofeli fan findi mangɛ rasima nan na. Arakika Xusayi findi mangɛ dɛfanboore nan na. <verse eid="1CH 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 27:34" />Bɛnaya nun Abiyatari xa di Yehoyada naxa findi Axitofeli ɲɔxɔɛ ra. Yowaba naxa findi sɔɔrie xa mangɛ xungbe ra.<verse eid="1CH 27:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1CH 28" />
  <para style="s">Dawuda waxɔnfe Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 28:1" />Dawuda naxa Isirayila xunyie birin malan Darisalamu, bɔnsɔɛ xunyie, sɔɔri xundɛe xunyie, mixi wulu nun mixi kɛmɛ xunyie, mangɛ xa naafuli mɛɛnimae, mangɛ xa xurusee mɛɛnimae, mangɛ xa die mɛɛnimae, mangɛ xa denbaya mɛɛnimae, xɛmɛ gbangbalanyie, nun kuntigi birin. <verse eid="1CH 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 28:2" />Mangɛ Dawuda naxa ti, a a masen e bɛ, «N ngaxakerenyie nun n ma ɲama, wo wo tuli mati n na. Natɛ nu na n bɛ, n xa banxi ti Alatala xa saatɛ kankira dɔxɔma dɛnnaxɛ, naxan nɔma findide won Marigi Ala lude ra. Na kui, n bara na wali fɔlɔ.»<verse eid="1CH 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 28:3" />«Kɔnɔ Ala naxa a masen n bɛ ‹I mu banxi tima n bɛ n luma dɛnnaxɛ, barima yihadila nan i ra. I bara adamadie faxa.› <verse eid="1CH 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 28:4" />Isirayila Marigi Alatala n tan nan sugandixi n baba xa mixi birin tagi, n xa findi Isirayila mangɛ ra abadan, barima a Yuda nan sugandixi a xa findi xunyi ra, a n baba xa denbaya sugandi Yuda bɔnsɔɛ birin tagi. N baba xa die birin ya ma, a n tan nan sugandixi, n xa findi Isirayila mangɛ ra. <verse eid="1CH 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 28:5" />N ma di xɛmɛ wuyaxie tagi, Ala naxee fixi n ma, a n ma di Sulemani nan sugandixi Isirayila mangɛ ra, Alatala xa mangɛya bun ma.»<verse eid="1CH 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 28:6" />«Ala naxa a masen n bɛ ‹I xa di Sulemani nan n ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi nun a tɛtɛ tima, barima n bara a sugandi n ma di ra, n tan yɛtɛ yati nan findima a baba ra. <verse eid="1CH 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 28:7" />N fama a xa mangɛya rasabatide abadan, xa a n ma yaamarie nun n ma sɛriyɛe rabatuma alɔ a na rabafe ki naxɛ to.›»<verse eid="1CH 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 28:8" />«To lɔxɔɛ, n bara a fala won Marigi Ala ya xɔri Isirayilaka birin bɛ, Alatala xa ɲama, wo xa wo Marigi Alatala xa sɛriyɛ birin nabatu. Wo xa na natɛ tongo Ala ya xɔri naxan wo xui birin namɛma. Wo xa na raba alako wo xa yi bɔxi fanyi masɔtɔ, a xa findi kɛ ra wo xa die bɛ naxee fama wo xanbi ra abadan. <verse eid="1CH 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 28:9" />N ma di Sulemani, i xa i baba Marigi Alatala kolon, a naxan batuma. I fan xa a batu i bɔɲɛ nun i ɲanige birin na, barima Alatala a kolon naxan na sondonyi birin kui. A adama ɲanige birin kolon. Xa i Alatala fen, a tinma nɛ i xa a to. Kɔnɔ xa i a rabɛɲin, a fan i rabɛɲinma nɛ kerenyi ra. <verse eid="1CH 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 28:10" />I xa a mato, Alatala bara i sugandi, alako i xa a xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi ti. I xa limaniya, i xa na wali suxu.»<verse eid="1CH 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 28:11" />Dawuda naxa hɔrɔmɔbanxi ti ki tagi raba Sulemani bɛ, a tɛtɛ, a rabilinyi banxie, naafuli yire, konkoe itexie, konkoe gbɛtɛe, nun saatɛ kankira dɔxɔde. <verse eid="1CH 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 28:12" />Dawuda naxa fe birin masen a xa di bɛ naxan nu na a xaxili ma Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi tife ra, alɔ tɛtɛ, konkoe, naafuli yire, nun se sɛniyɛnxie yire. <verse eid="1CH 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 28:13" />A man naxa a tagi raba a bɛ sɛrɛxɛdubɛe nun Lewikae itaxunma ki naxɛ, a nun e walima ki naxɛ Alatala xa banxi kui. A naxa se birin masen a bɛ naxan nawalima Alatala xa banxi kui. <verse eid="1CH 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 28:14" />A naxa wali se xɛɛma daaxie nun gbeti daaxie xa binyɛ xasabi masen a bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 28:15" />A naxa lanpui dɔxɔsee nun lanpuie xa binyɛ xasabi masen a bɛ, naxee yailanma xɛɛma ra a nun naxee yailanma gbeti ra. <verse eid="1CH 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 28:16" />A naxa xɛɛma nun gbeti binyɛ xasabi masen a bɛ naxan yailanma teebilie ra sɛrɛxɛ taami sama naxee fari. <verse eid="1CH 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 28:17" />A naxa yirabase xɛɛma nun gbeti daaxi mɔɔli birin xa binyɛ xasabi masen a bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 28:18" />A naxa surayi sɛrɛxɛbade xɛɛma daaxi xa binyɛ xasabi masen a bɛ, a nun na yailan ki. A naxa a masen a bɛ na mangɛ ragise nun na malekɛ sawurɛ xɛɛma daaxie, naxee gabutenyie italaxi Alatala xa saatɛ kankira xun ma, nee yailanma ki naxɛ.<verse eid="1CH 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 28:19" />Dawuda naxa a fala a bɛ, «Alatala nan yi birin sɛbɛxi. N naxan masenxi i bɛ a fatanxi a xaxili nan na.» <verse eid="1CH 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 28:20" />Dawuda naxa a fala a xa di Sulemani bɛ, «I sɛnbɛ so, i xa limaniya. Wali suxu. I naxa gaaxu fefe ma, barima n Marigi Alatala na i sɛɛti ma. A mu i rabɛɲinma. A mu i raboloma han i gɛ a xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi wali birin na. <verse eid="1CH 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 28:21" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ nun Lewika xundɛ birin na i xanbi ra Ala xa banxi xa wali xa fe ra. Walikɛ mɔɔli birin na naa naxee fata wali ra. Kuntigie nun ɲama fan e tuli matima i xa yaamari birin na.»<verse eid="1CH 28:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1CH 29" />
  <para style="s">Dawuda xa masenyi Isirayila bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 29:1" />Mangɛ Dawuda naxa a fala ɲama birin bɛ, «N ma di Sulemani, Ala naxan sugandixi, a mu gɛxi mɔde, a sɛnbɛ mu gbo sinden. Wali naxan na be, a gbo, barima banxi xa mu a ra naxan tima mixi bɛ. A tima Alatala nan bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 29:2" />N bara n sɛnbɛ birin sa n Marigi Ala sagoe a xa banxi tife ra. N bara xɛɛma, gbeti, yɔxui, wure, wuri, gɛmɛ tofanyi, diyaman mɔɔli birin, nun gɛmɛ fiixɛ gbegbe malan, alako e xa rawali e rawali ki ma. <verse eid="1CH 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 29:3" />Dangi na ra, n bara n harige birin, xɛɛma nun gbeti, fi n Marigi Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa fe ra, barima yi wali tide gbo n bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 29:4" />N harige nan ya: xɛɛma Ofiri daaxi kilo wulu kɛmɛ wulu firin, gbeti fanyi kilo wulu kɛmɛ firin tongo saxan nun solomasaxan. Na findima banxi yiree maso se nan na. <verse eid="1CH 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 29:5" />Xɛɛma nun gbeti birin xa rawali a rawali ki ma, alako walikɛe xa wali xa sɔɔnɛya. Yakɔsi, nde bara ɲanige nde tongo Alatala bɛ to?»<verse eid="1CH 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 29:6" />Denbaya xunyie, Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ kuntigie, mixi wulu nun mixi kɛmɛ xunyie, nun mangɛ xa wali xunyie naxa ɲanige tongo yi wali xa fe ra. <verse eid="1CH 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 29:7" />E naxa yi harige xasabi fi Ala xa banxi xa fe ra: xɛɛma, kilo wulu kɛmɛ tongo solofere, gbeti kilo wulu kɛmɛ saxan tongo naani, yɔxui kilo wulu kɛmɛ senni fu nun firin, a nun wure kilo miliyɔn saxan wulu kɛmɛ naani. <verse eid="1CH 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 29:8" />Birin naxa gɛmɛ tofanyie so Yɛxiyɛli Gerisonka yi ra, naxan nu naafuli ragatama Alatala xa banxi xa fe ra. <verse eid="1CH 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 29:9" />Ɲama naxa sɛɛwa e ɲanige xa fe ra, barima e na rabaxi e bɔɲɛ birin nan na Alatala bɛ. Mangɛ Dawuda fan naxa sɛɛwa na xa fe ra.<verse eid="1CH 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 29:10" />Dawuda naxa Alatala tantu ɲama birin ya xɔri. A naxa a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:10">«Muxu benba Isirayila Marigi Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:10">tantui na i bɛ abadan.<verse eid="1CH 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 29:11" />Alatala, binyɛ, sɛnbɛ, nun matɔxɔɛ birin na i bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:11">Se naxan birin na koore nun bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:11">i tan nan gbe a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:11">Duniɲa birin na i tan nan xa mangɛya bun ma.<verse eid="1CH 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 29:12" />Bannaya nun xunnakeli fatanxi i tan nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:12">I se birin yamarima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:12">sɛnbɛ birin na i yi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:12">I keren nan nɔma mixi gbode,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:12">i keren nan nɔma a rasabatide.»<verse eid="1CH 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 29:13" />«Muxu Marigi Ala, to, muxu bara i tantu, muxu bara i xili makaabaxi matɔxɔ. <verse eid="1CH 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 29:14" />N tan nun n ma ɲama sɛnbɛ mu nɔma yi harige mɔɔli sɔtɔde. A birin kelima i tan nan ma. Muxu tan mu sese fima, i tan singe mu naxan fixi muxu ma. <verse eid="1CH 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 29:15" />Muxu luma alɔ xɔɲɛe i ya i, alɔ muxu benbae. Muxu xa simaya luxi nɛ yi bɛndɛ fuɲi fari alɔ niini naxan minima a mu bu a lɔɛ. Xaxili tide yo mu na muxu bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 29:16" />Muxu Marigi Alatala, yi harige fanyi birin kelima i tan nan ma, muxu naxan xunlanxi alako muxu xa banxi ti i xili sɛniyɛnxi bɛ. I tan nan gbe na a birin na.»<verse eid="1CH 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 29:17" />«N Marigi Ala, n a kolon i bɔɲɛ birin kolon, tinxinyi man rafan i ma. N yi sɛrɛxɛ ɲanigexi i bɛ n bɔɲɛ tinxinxi nan na. N man bara a to, i xa ɲama fan sɛrɛxɛ fixi i ma a tan ɲanige kerenyi nan kui e sɛɛwaxi ra. <verse eid="1CH 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 29:18" />Muxu babae Iburahima, Isiyaga, Isirayila Marigi Alatala, i xa yi xaxili rasabati i xa ɲama bɔɲɛ kui, alako e naxa i yanfa. <verse eid="1CH 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 29:19" />N ma di Sulemani mali alako a fan xa bira i xa yaamari, i xa xaranyi, nun i xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra a bɔɲɛ birin na. A man xa yi banxi ti n naxan fɔlɔxi yi ki.»<verse eid="1CH 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 29:20" />Dawuda naxa a fala ɲama birin bɛ, «Wo wo Marigi Alatala tantu.» Ɲama naxa e babae Marigi Alatala tantu, e fa e igoro, e e felen Alatala bɛ mangɛ ya xɔri. <verse eid="1CH 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 29:21" />Na lɔxɔɛ kuye iba, Isirayila naxa sɛrɛxɛe nun sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi gbegbe ba Alatala bɛ: tuura wulu keren, yɛxɛɛ kontonyi wulu keren, yɛxɛɛ lanma wulu keren, wɛni sɛrɛxɛ, a nun sɛrɛxɛ gbɛtɛe. <verse eid="1CH 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 29:22" />E naxa e dɛge na lɔxɔɛ, e e min Alatala ya i ɲɛlɛxinyi belebele kui. E man naxa Dawuda xa di Sulemani ti mangɛ ra a sanmaya firin nde. E naxa ture sa a xunyi ma Alatala ya i, a xa findi e xa yarerati ra. E naxa Sadɔki fan ti sɛrɛxɛdubɛ ra. <verse eid="1CH 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 29:23" />Sulemani naxa dɔxɔ Alatala xa mangɛ kibanyi kui, a findi mangɛ ra a baba Dawuda ɲɔxɔɛ ra. A naxa xunnakeli sɔtɔ, Isirayila birin naxa a xa yaamari rabatu. <verse eid="1CH 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 29:24" />Kuntigie, sɔɔrie, nun mangɛ Dawuda xa die birin naxa tin lude mangɛ Sulemani xa yaamari bun ma. <verse eid="1CH 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 29:25" />Alatala naxa Sulemani xa fe ite Isirayilaka birin ya xɔri. A naxa a xa mangɛya ite dangi Isirayila mangɛ singee birin na.<verse eid="1CH 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dawuda xa laaxira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 29:26" />Yisayi xa di Dawuda naxa mangɛya raba Isirayila birin xun na. <verse eid="1CH 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 29:27" />A ɲɛ tongo naani mangɛya nan naba. A ɲɛ solofere raba Xebiron, a ɲɛ tongo saxan nun saxan naba Darisalamu. <verse eid="1CH 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 29:28" />A naxa simaya fanyi kamalixi sɔtɔ, a laaxiraya foriɲa fanyi nun sɛɛwɛ kui. Harige kanyi nan nu a ra, a xili fan nu gbo. A xa di Sulemani nan ti mangɛ ra a ɲɔxɔɛ ra. <verse eid="1CH 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 29:29" />Mangɛ Dawuda naxan nabaxi, a fɔlɛ nun a raɲɔnyi, na birin sɛbɛxi Annabi Samuweli, Annabi Natan, nun Annabi Gadi xa kitaabuie kui. <verse eid="1CH 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 29:30" />Yi kitaabuie a xa mangɛya fanyi xa fe falama, naxan dangixi a xa waxati Isirayila bɔxi ma nun bɔxi gbɛtɛe ma.<verse eid="1CH 29:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 29" />
</usx>